2017/08/Parameter-Monitor-480x480.jpg\" class=\"attachment-layers-square-medium size-layers-square-medium\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://wp.ig-medical.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/08/Parameter-Monitor-480x480.jpg 480w, http://wp.ig-medical.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/08/Parameter-Monitor-150x150.jpg 150w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 480px) 100vw, 480px\"></div></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><div class=\"media-body text-center\"></p><p><h5 class=\"heading\"></p><p>Patient Monitor (XP Series)</h5></p><p><div class=\"excerpt\"><p>Multiparameter type and modular type in different sizes</p></div></p><p></div></p><p></div></p><p></div></p><p><br></p><p><div id=\"layers-widget-column-3-228\" class=\"layers-widget-column-3-228 layers-masonry-column layers-widget-column-228 span-4    column  has-image\"></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><div class=\"media image-top small\"></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><div class=\"media-image \"></p><p><img width=\"286\" height=\"300\" src=\"http://wp.ig-medical.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/ekg-e1507553336243.jpg\" class=\"attachment-layers--medium size-layers--medium\" alt=\"\"></div></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><div class=\"media-body text-center\"></p><p><h5 class=\"heading\"></p><p>Electrocardiograph (EKG Series)</h5></p><p><div class=\"excerpt\"><p>3, 6 and 12 channel electrocardiographs</p><p>– build in printer</p><p>– asdasd</p></div></p><p></div></p><p></div></p><p></div></p><p><br></p><p><div id=\"layers-widget-column-3-881\" class=\"layers-widget-column-3-881 layers-masonry-column layers-widget-column-881 span-4  last  column  has-image\"></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><div class=\"media image-top small\"></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><div class=\"media-image \"></p><p><img width=\"480\" height=\"480\" src=\"http://wp.ig-medical.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/MAX_VI-2-480x480.jpg\" class=\"attachment-layers-square-medium size-layers-square-medium\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://wp.ig-medical.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/MAX_VI-2-480x480.jpg 480w, http://wp.ig-medical.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/MAX_VI-2-150x150.jpg 150w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 480px) 100vw, 480px\"></div></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><div class=\"media-body text-center\"></p><p><h5 class=\"heading\"></p><p>Electrosurgical unit (MAX Series)</h5></p><p><div class=\"excerpt\"><p>Give us a brief description of what you are promoting. Try keep it short so that it is easy for people to scan your page.</p></div></p><p></div></p><p></div></p><p></div></p><p><br></p><p><div id=\"layers-widget-column-3-740\" class=\"layers-widget-column-3-740 layers-masonry-column layers-widget-column-740 span-4  first  column  has-image\"></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><div class=\"media image-top small\"></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><div class=\"media-image \"></p><p><img width=\"601\" height=\"351\" src=\"http://wp.ig-medical.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/08/5.jpg\" class=\"attachment-layers--medium size-layers--medium\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://wp.ig-medical.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/08/5.jpg 601w, http://wp.ig-medical.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/08/5-300x175.jpg 300w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 601px) 100vw, 601px\"></div></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><div class=\"media-body text-center\"></p><p><h5 class=\"heading\"></p><p>Operation table (TAB Series)</h5></p><p><div class=\"excerpt\"><p>Manual hydraulic, electric and electro hydraulic</p></div></p><p></div></p><p></div></p><p></div></p><p><br></p><p><div id=\"layers-widget-column-3-299\" class=\"layers-widget-column-3-299 layers-masonry-column layers-widget-column-299 span-4    column  has-image\"></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><div class=\"media image-top small\"></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><div class=\"media-image \"></p><p><img width=\"2500\" height=\"1645\" src=\"http://wp.ig-medical.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/08/LAM-LED-III.jpg\" class=\"attachment-layers--medium size-layers--medium\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://wp.ig-medical.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/08/LAM-LED-III.jpg 2500w, http://wp.ig-medical.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/08/LAM-LED-III-300x197.jpg 300w, http://wp.ig-medical.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/08/LAM-LED-III-768x505.jpg 768w, http://wp.ig-medical.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/08/LAM-LED-III-1024x674.jpg 1024w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 2500px) 100vw, 2500px\"></div></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><div class=\"media-body text-center\"></p><p><h5 class=\"heading\"></p><p>Opertation lamp (LAM Series)</h5></p><p><div class=\"excerpt\"><p>Give us a brief description of what you are promoting. Try keep it short so that it is easy for people to scan your page.</p></div></p><p></div></p><p></div></p><p></div></p><p><br></p><p><div id=\"layers-widget-column-3-916\" class=\"layers-widget-column-3-916 layers-masonry-column layers-widget-column-916 span-4  last  column  has-image\"></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><div class=\"media image-top small\"></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><div class=\"media-image \"></p><p><img width=\"3579\" height=\"523\" src=\"http://wp.ig-medical.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/Endo-Cure.png\" class=\"attachment-layers--medium size-layers--medium\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://wp.ig-medical.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/Endo-Cure.png 3579w, http://wp.ig-medical.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/Endo-Cure-300x44.png 300w, http://wp.ig-medical.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/Endo-Cure-768x112.png 768w, http://wp.ig-medical.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/Endo-Cure-1024x150.png 1024w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 3579px) 100vw, 3579px\"></div></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><div class=\"media-body text-center\"></p><p><h5 class=\"heading\"></p><p>Gastroenterology</h5></p><p><div class=\"excerpt\"><p>Under our brand name „endocure“ <span><span><span><span>we offer a full range of flexible endoscopic endoscopic accessories and further innovative gastroenterological products such E.G.G</span></span></span>.</span></p></div></p><p></div></p><p></div></p><p></div></p><p></div><!-- /row --></p><p></div></p><p><style id=\"layers_widget_column_inline_css\" type=\"text/css\"> /* INLINE WIDGET CSS */</