 excellent results</li><li>Provides smooth cuts with optimal performance on adipose tissues</li><li>Absolute output power at every mode of Coagulation, Blend, Bipolar like variable power of general ESU. &nbsp;It minimizes the carbonization and second bleeding by adhesion of the tissue</li><li>Complex &nbsp;Patient protect system for more safety</li><li>2 Monopolar output</li><li>Various Cutting, Coagulation and Bipolar Modes</li><li>Spray Coagulation Function</li></ul><p><br></p><p><br></p><div style=\"text-align:center; width:8em; background:#5B92D3;\"><a href=\"http://www.ig-medical.com/kontaktseite/\" style=\"color:white;text-decoration:none;font-size:1.5em;\">More Info</a></div><p><br></p>\";s:6:\"button\";a:6:{s:9:\"link_type\";s:6:\"custom\";s:16:\"link_type_custom\";s:0:\"\";s:14:\"link_type_post\";s:0:\"\";s:27:\"link_type_post_type_archive\";s:0:\"\";s:26:\"link_type_taxonomy_archive\";s:0:\"\";s:9:\"link_text\";s:0:\"\";}}}}i:63;a:5:{s:6:\"design\";a:7:{s:6:\"layout\";s:12:\"layout-boxed\";s:8:\"advanced\";a:5:{s:7:\"padding\";a:4:{s:3:\"top\";s:0:\"\";s:5:\"right\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"bottom\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"left\";s:0:\"\";}s:6:\"margin\";a:4:{s:3:\"top\";s:0:\"\";s:5:\"right\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"bottom\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"left\";s:0:\"\";}s:6:\"anchor\";s:0:\"\";s:11:\"customclass\";s:0:\"\";s:9:\"customcss\";s:0:\"\";}s:9:\"liststyle\";s:9:\"list-grid\";s:6:\"gutter\";s:2:\"on\";s:15:\"gutter-CHECKBOX\";s:2:\"on\";s:10:\"background\";a:6:{s:5:\"color\";s:0:\"\";s:5:\"image\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"repeat\";s:9:\"no-repeat\";s:8:\"position\";s:6:\"center\";s:16:\"stretch-CHECKBOX\";s:2:\"on\";s:15:\"darken-CHECKBOX\";s:2:\"on\";}s:5:\"fonts\";a:4:{s:4:\"size\";s:6:\"medium\";s:5:\"align\";s:9:\"text-left\";s:5:\"color\";s:0:\"\";s:13:\"excerpt-color\";s:0:\"\";}}s:5:\"title\";s:10:\"MAX Series\";s:7:\"excerpt\";s:0:\"\";s:10:\"column_ids\";s:3:\"948\";s:7:\"columns\";a:1:{i:948;a:5:{s:6:\"design\";a:6:{s:10:\"background\";a:4:{s:5:\"color\";s:0:\"\";s:5:\"image\";s:0:\"\";