; build in printer&#8211; asdasd\n\n<img width=\"1024\" height=\"607\" src=\"http://wp.ig-medical.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/08/MAX-VI-oben.jpg\" />				\n\nElectrosurgical unit (MAX Series)																											\n																																					Give us a brief description of what you are promoting. Try keep it short so that it is easy for people to scan your page.\n\n<img width=\"601\" height=\"351\" src=\"http://wp.ig-medical.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/08/5.jpg\" />				\n\nOperation table (TAB Series)																											\n																																					Manual hydraulic, electric and electro hydraulic\n\n<img width=\"2500\" height=\"1645\" src=\"http://wp.ig-medical.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/08/LAM-LED-III.jpg\" />				\n\nOpertation lamp (LAM Series)																											\n																																					Give us a brief description of what you are promoting. Try keep it short so that it is easy for people to scan your page.\n\n<img width=\"3579\" height=\"523\" src=\"http://wp.ig-medical.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/Endo-Cure.png\" />				\n\nGastroenterology																											\n																																					Under our brand name &#8222;endocure&#8220; we offer a full range of flexible endoscopic endoscopic accessories and further innovative gastroenterological products such E.G.G.\n\n<!-- /row -->\n\n','Products','','inherit','closed','closed','','39-revision-v1','','','2017-10-09 10:10:53','2017-10-09 08:10:53','a:4:{s:7:\"post_id\";i:39;s:9:\"post_hash\";s:44:\"layers_page_b523231988a37515a7c52edd0d37a969\";s:10:\"post_title\";s:8:\"Products\";s:11:\"widget_data\";a:1:{s:22:\"obox-layers-builder-39\";a:2:{s:22:\"layers-widget-column-4\";a:5:{s:6:\"design\";a:7:{s:6:\"layout\";s:16:\"layout-fullwidth\";s:8:\"advanced\";a:5:{s:7:\"padding\";a:4:{s:3:\"top\";s:0:\"\";s:5:\"right\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"bottom\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"left\";s:0:\"\";}s:6:\"margin\";a:4:{s:3:\"top\";s:0:\"\";s:5:\"right\";s:1:\"0\";s:6:\"bottom\";