g\" />				\n\n<!-- .container -->\n								 <!-- .overlay -->\n\n</a>\n\nProduct features:								\n\n<img width=\"2441\" height=\"2441\" src=\"http://www.ig-medical.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/12/XP-IVM-Black-Site.png\" />				\n\nBased on a plug-and-play modular structure, monitoring functions can be quickly adjusted according to your specific clinical requirements. An intuitive interface with configurable user modes and easy to use functions helps you to save time and improve overall patient care.&nbsp;High resolution TFT touch screen display with auto screen layoutCan display up to 13 parameters at onceResting 12-channel ECG analysisHigh storage capacity:Up to 2 hours single-channel ECG data storageUp to 480h trend/graphic storage and reviewS-T segment anylisis and &gt;23 tpyes of arrhythmia analysisSuitable for adult, peadiatric and neonate patientsEasy drug calculation interfaceDefibrillator discharge protectionBed to bed view for comfortable patient visitVisual and audible alarmsRechargeable and exchangeable batteries( up to 10 hours working time)<a href=\"http://www.ig-medical.com/kontaktseite/\">More Info</a>\n\n<!-- /row -->\n\n','Modular','','publish','closed','closed','','modular','','','2019-09-19 11:09:10','2019-09-19 09:09:10','a:4:{s:7:\"post_id\";i:187;s:9:\"post_hash\";s:44:\"layers_page_346c6dc7d426321b05f37a502d0c7d14\";s:10:\"post_title\";s:7:\"Modular\";s:11:\"widget_data\";a:1:{s:23:\"obox-layers-builder-187\";a:2:{s:22:\"layers-widget-slide-36\";a:14:{s:6:\"design\";a:2:{s:6:\"layout\";s:16:\"layout-fullwidth\";s:8:\"advanced\";a:5:{s:7:\"padding\";a:4:{s:3:\"top\";s:0:\"\";s:5:\"right\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"bottom\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"left\";s:0:\"\";}s:6:\"margin\";a:4:{s:3:\"top\";s:0:\"\";s:5:\"right\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"bottom\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"left\";s:0:\"\";}s:6:\"anchor\";s:0:\"\";s:11:\"customclass\";s:0:\"\";s:9:\"customcss\";s:0:\"\";}}s:26:\"autoheight_slides-CHECKBOX\";s:2:\"on\";s:12:\"slide_height\";s:3:\"550\";s:18:\"show_slider_arrows\";s:2