able and exchangeable batteries( up to 10 hours working time)</li></ul><p><br></p><div style=\"text-align:center; width:8em; background:#5B92D3;\"><a href=\"http://www.ig-medical.com/kontaktseite/\" style=\"color:white;text-decoration:none;font-size:1.5em;\">More Info</a></div><p><br></p>\";s:6:\"button\";a:6:{s:9:\"link_type\";s:6:\"custom\";s:16:\"link_type_custom\";s:0:\"\";s:14:\"link_type_post\";s:0:\"\";s:27:\"link_type_post_type_archive\";s:0:\"\";s:26:\"link_type_taxonomy_archive\";s:0:\"\";s:9:\"link_text\";s:0:\"\";}}}}}}}',191,'http://wp.ig-medical.com/?page_id=187',1,'page','',0),(188,1,'2017-10-09 12:46:28','2017-10-09 10:46:28','<table border=\"0\" width=\"80%\" cellspacing=\"10\" cellpadding=\"10\" bgcolor=\"#EDF0F2\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><img src=\"http://www.ig-medical.de/uploads/images/Monitor Modular.jpg\" width=\"210\" height=\"210\" /></td>\r\n<td valign=\"top\">\r\n<h1 class=\"style1\"><span class=\"style4\">Modular Patient Monitor</span></h1>\r\n<table border=\"0\" width=\"95%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" align=\"right\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td class=\"style3\">\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>High-resolution color TFT display</li>\r\n 	<li>Arrhythmia analysis and ST segment analysis</li>\r\n 	<li>Up to 480 hours trend data storage and review</li>\r\n 	<li>Adult,Paediatric and Neonate</li>\r\n 	<li>Drug calculation</li>\r\n 	<li>Bed to Bed view</li>\r\n 	<li>Protection against discharge of defibrillator</li>\r\n 	<li>Visual and audible alarms</li>\r\n 	<li>Standard parameters:\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>ECG, RESP, SpO2, NIBP, TEMP, PR</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n 	<li>Li-ion batteries up to 10h</li>\r\n 	<li>Colour coded socket</li>\r\n 	<li>Dual USP ports, network interface, Defibrillation synchronization interface, Analog output interface</li>\r\n 	<li>Optional:\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>12-lead ECG, 4-IBP, EtCO2, AG, CO, CSM, BIS, NMT, touch screen, VGA, Wi-Fi, backlight buttons, trolley, wall bracket, recorder, central monitoring system</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</l