mpromising on patient safety. All electro-hydraulic adjustments are controlled via user friendly hand controls, either wireless or wired, or foot control units.\n\n<a href=\"http://www.ig-medical.com/startseite/surgical-table/electro-hydraulic/\">\n							<img width=\"4217\" height=\"2409\" src=\"http://www.ig-medical.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/11/Electro-hydraulic-VG.jpg\" />						</a>\n\n<a href=\"http://www.ig-medical.com/startseite/surgical-table/electro-hydraulic/\">\n																													Electro-hydraulic																													</a>\n\n<a href=\"http://www.ig-medical.com/startseite/surgical-table/electric-table/\">\n							<img width=\"661\" height=\"357\" src=\"http://www.ig-medical.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/tab-electro-hydraulic.jpg\" />						</a>\n\n<a href=\"http://www.ig-medical.com/startseite/surgical-table/electric-table/\">\n																													Electric																													</a>\n\n<a href=\"http://www.ig-medical.com/startseite/surgical-table/manual/\">\n							<img width=\"511\" height=\"323\" src=\"http://www.ig-medical.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/tab-manual.jpg\" />						</a>\n\n<a href=\"http://www.ig-medical.com/startseite/surgical-table/manual/\">\n																													Manual																													</a>\n\n<!-- /row -->\n\n','Surgical table','','inherit','closed','closed','','492-revision-v1','','','2017-11-09 19:23:49','2017-11-09 18:23:49','a:4:{s:7:\"post_id\";i:492;s:9:\"post_hash\";s:44:\"layers_page_065a0609aefa4cf6d442fb9e33a11a43\";s:10:\"post_title\";s:14:\"Surgical table\";s:11:\"widget_data\";a:1:{s:23:\"obox-layers-builder-492\";a:2:{s:21:\"layers-widget-slide-6\";a:16:{s:6:\"design\";a:2:{s:6:\"layout\";s:12:\"layout-boxed\";s:8:\"advanced\";a:5:{s:7:\"padding\";a:4:{s:3:\"top\";s:0:\"\";s:5:\"right\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"bottom\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"left\";s:0:\"\";}s:6:\"margin\";a:4:{s:3:\"top\";s:0:\"\";s:5:\"right\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"bottom\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"left\";s:0:\"\";}s:6:\"anchor\";s:0