l as establish long-term esteeming relationships with our customers.</p><p>Our products are marked by outstanding quality and maximum reliability. These are features that, while striving to reach perfection, we continue to optimize through an ongoing process of innovation.</p><p>In the field of medical technology and equipment, where the life and wellbeing of patient is at stake, quality and reliability is imperative. Patients, users and retailers can rely on the experience and expert knowledge of the IG team.</p><p>The international team of doctors and engineers is working hard on the research, development, manufacture, and sales of medical equipment and have recourse to over 20 years of experience and technical knowledge. Developing new products we take the needs and feedback of users, i.e. doctors and care personnel, into account, in addition to our technical knowhow.</p><p>Multiple costumers of IG GmbH are already convinced of the exceptional quality of our products. Currently we have established a network of costumers in many countries on various continents. In the pursuit of expanding this network we focus on long-term business relations.</p><p>Our Mission is it to provide medical equipment and technology<br><br></p><ul><li>- of the highest quality</li><li>- with maximum user friendliness</li><li>- at affordable costs</li><li>- through consistent costumer relations</li></ul><p>At the moment our group consist of three members:<br><br></p><ul><li><strong>Operating-room and ICU equipment (<a href=\"http://www.ig-medical.de/\">IG Medical</a>):</strong><br>Patient monitors<br>ECG machines<br>Electrosurgical generators<br>Surgical lighting<br>Operating tables</li><li><strong>Gastroenterology (<a href=\"http://www.endocure.de/\" target=\"_blank\">Endocure</a>):</strong><br>Full range of flexible endoscopic accessories<br>Electro-Gastro-Graphs. (E.G.G.)<br>Capsule Endoscope Systems</li><li><strong>Diagnostic equipment (<a href=\"http://www.ig-technology.de/\" target=\