le system to achieve comfort operating</li>\r\n 	<li>Multi-layer memory foam: Water proof, antibacterial and antistatic</li>\r\n 	<li>Intelligent battery management system</li>\r\n 	<li>Two independent controlling systems</li>\r\n 	<li>Handheld controller / wireless controller / emergency panel</li>\r\n 	<li>Emergency override controlling system</li>\r\n 	<li>Wide range of accessories\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Optional: Carbon fibre plate</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>','Electro-hydraulic','','inherit','closed','closed','','1218-autosave-v1','','','2017-11-09 19:46:51','2017-11-09 18:46:51','',1218,'http://www.ig-medical.com/2017/11/09/1218-autosave-v1/',0,'revision','',0),(1399,1,'2017-11-09 19:50:24','2017-11-09 18:50:24','<ul>\n 	<li>Much more efficient than low frequency, produces less heat, not to mention sparkle, resulting in less burned tissue</li>\n 	<li>Fast healing with excellent results</li>\n 	<li>Provides smooth cuts with optimal performance on adipose tissues</li>\n 	<li>Absolute output power at every mode of Coagulation, Blend, Bipolar like variable power of general ESU.  It minimizes the carbonization and second bleeding by adhesion of the tissue</li>\n 	<li>User can save or open their frequently used data/favorite programs up to 100 programmable memory locations with several touch motions</li>\n 	<li>Complex  Patient protect system for more safety</li>\n 	<li>REM system</li>\n 	<li>2 Monopolar output</li>\n 	<li>Various Cutting, Coagulation and Bipolar Modes</li>\n 	<li>Spray Coagulation Function</li>\n 	<li>*Large vessel sealing system</li>\n 	<li>Endo Mode</li>\n 	<li>Bipolar Cutting Mode</li>\n</ul>','Touch screen','','inherit','closed','closed','','1238-autosave-v1','','','2017-11-09 19:50:24','2017-11-09 18:50:24','',1238,'http://www.ig-medical.com/2017/11/09/1238-autosave-v1/',0,'revision','',0),(1400,1,'2017-11-09 19:50:55','2017-11-09 18:50:55','<ul>\r\n 	<li>Up to 400Watt output power</li>\r\n 	<li>Much more efficient than low frequency, produces less heat, not to mention sparkle, resulting in less burned tissue</li>\r\n 	<li>Fast healing with excellent results</li>\r\n 	<li>Provides smooth cuts with optimal performance on adipose tissues</li>\r\n 	<li>Absolute output power at every mode of Coagulation, Blend, Bipolar like variable power of general ESU.  It minimizes the carbonization and second bleeding by adhesion of the tissue</li>\r\n 	<li>User can save or open their frequently used data/favorite programs up to 100 programmable memory locations with several touch motions</li>\r\n 	<li>Complex  Patient protect system for more safety</li>\r\n 	<li>REM system</li>\r\n 	<li>2 Monopolar output</li>\r\n 	<li>Various Cutting, Coagulation and Bipolar Modes</li>\r\n 	<li>Spray Coagulation Function</li>\r\n 	<li>*Large vessel sealing system</li>\r\n 	<li>Endo Mode</li>\r\n 	<li>Bipolar Cutting Mode</li>\r\n</ul>','Touch screen','','inherit','closed','closed','','1238-revision-v1','','','2017-11-09 19:50:55','2017-11-09 18:50:55','',1238,'http://www.ig-medical.com/2017/11/09/1238-revision-v1/',0,'revision','',0),(1405,1,'2017-11-09 19:54:25','2017-11-09 18:54:25','\n\n\n\n<img width=\"3642\" height=\"1244\" src=\"http://www.ig-medical.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/11/TAB.png\" />				\n\n<!-- .container -->\n								 <!-- .overlay -->\n\nTAB SERIES			All surgical tables from our TAB Series meeting the strictest demands of modern operating theatres. With its modular table top and comprehensive range of accessories, the electro-hydraulic table an be configured for each surgical procedure and for all patient sizes in the best possible way. lt provides open access to the operated area and creates excellent working ergonomics for the surgical team without compromising on patient safety. All electro-hydraulic adjustments are controlled via user friendly hand controls, either wireless or wired, or foot control units.\n\n<a href=\"http://www.ig-medical.com/startseite/surgical-table/electro-hydraulic/\">\n							<img width=\"4217\" height=\"2409\" src=\"http://www.ig-medical.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/11/Electro-hydraulic-VG.jpg\" />						</a>\n\n<a href=\"http://www.ig-medical.com/startseite/surgical-table/electro-hydraulic/\">\n																													Electro-hydraulic																													</a>\n\n<a href=\"http://www.ig-medical.com/startseite/surgical-table/electric-table/\">\n							<img width=\"661\" height=\"357\" src=\"http://www.ig-medical.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/tab-electro-hydraulic.jpg\" />						</a>\n\n<a href=\"http://www.ig-medical.com/startseite/surgical-table/electric-table/\">\n																													Electric																													</a>\n\n<a href=\"http://www.ig-medical.com/startseite/surgical-table/manual/\">\n							<img width=\"511\" height=\"323\" src=\"http://www.ig-medical.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/tab-manual.jpg\" />						</a>\n\n<a href=\"http://www.ig-medical.com/startseite/surgical-table/manual/\">\n																													Manual																													</a>\n\n<!-- /row -->\n\n','Surgical table','','inherit','closed','closed','','492-revision-v1','','','2017-11-09 19:54:25','2017-11-09 18:54:25','a:4:{s:7:\"post_id\";i:492;s:9:\"post_hash\";s:44:\"layers_page_065a0609aefa4cf6d442fb9e33a11a43\";s:10:\"post_title\";s:14:\"Surgical table\";s:11:\"widget_data\";a:1:{s:23:\"obox-layers-builder-492\";a:3:{s:21:\"layers-widget-slide-6\";a:16:{s:6:\"design\";a:2:{s:6:\"layout\";s:12:\"layout-boxed\";s:8:\"advanced\";a:5:{s:7:\"padding\";a:4:{s:3:\"top\";s:0:\"\";s:5:\"right\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"bottom\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"left\";s:0:\"\";}s:6:\"margin\";a:4:{s:3:\"top\";s:0:\"\";s:5:\"right\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"bottom\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"left\";s:0:\"\";}s:6:\"anchor\";s:0:\"\";s:11:\"customclass\";s:0:\"\";s:9:\"customcss\";s:0:\"\";}}s:17:\"autoheight_slides\";s:2:\"on\";s:26:\"autoheight_slides-CHECKBOX\";s:2:\"on\";s:12:\"slide_height\";s:3:\"550\";s:18:\"show_slider_arrows\";s:2:\"on\";s:27:\"show_slider_arrows-CHECKBOX\";s:2:\"on\";