of the exceptional quality of our products. Currently we have established a network of costumers in many countries on various continents. In the pursuit of expanding this network we focus on long-term business relations.</p><p>Our Mission is it to provide medical equipment and technology<br><br></p><ul><li>- of the highest quality</li><li>- with maximum user friendliness</li><li>- at affordable costs</li><li>- through consistent costumer relations</li></ul><p>At the moment our group consist of three members:<br><br></p><ul><li><strong>Operating-room and ICU equipment (<a href=\"http://www.ig-medical.de/\">IG Medical</a>):</strong><br>Patient monitors<br>ECG machines<br>Electrosurgical generators<br>Surgical lighting<br>Operating tables</li><li><strong>Gastroenterology (<a href=\"http://www.endocure.de/\" target=\"_blank\">Endocure</a>):</strong><br>Full range of flexible endoscopic accessories<br>Electro-Gastro-Graphs. (E.G.G.)<br>Capsule Endoscope Systems</li><li><strong>Diagnostic equipment (<a href=\"http://www.ig-technology.de/\" target=\"_blank\">IG Technology</a>):</strong><br>Innovative and cost-effective diagnostic technology</li></ul><p><br><strong>*Our company IG GmbH as well as our products are ISO 13485:2012 and CE certified according to respective requirements in the European directive 93/42/ EEC concerning medical devices which apply to it.</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><h3><span><strong>Our head office:</strong></span></h3><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span>International Group medical technology and electronics GmbH<br>Ellhornstrasse 12/14<br>28195 Bremen, Germany</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span><strong>Telefon:</strong><span>&nbsp;</span>+49 (0) 42 1/84 78 88 04<br><strong>Telefax:</strong><span>&nbsp;</span>+49 (0) 42 1/16 69 28 65</span></p><p><span><strong>E-mail: &nbsp;&nbsp;</strong><span>&nbsp;</span>info@ig-medical.de</span></p><p><span><span>&nbsp;<br></span></span></p></div></div>\";s:6:\"button\";a:6:{s:9:\"link_type\";s:6:\"custom\";s:16:\"link_type_custom\