lt\";s:0:\"\";s:9:\"link_type\";s:4:\"none\";s:8:\"link_url\";s:0:\"\";s:13:\"image_classes\";s:0:\"\";s:12:\"link_classes\";s:0:\"\";s:8:\"link_rel\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"link_target_blank\";s:0:\"\";s:11:\"image_title\";s:0:\"\";}s:7:\"text-27\";a:4:{s:5:\"title\";s:29:\"TAB Series - Manual hydraulic\";s:4:\"text\";s:707:\"<ul>\r\n 	<li>Enables a wide range of configurations for general and special surgery</li>\r\n 	<li>Accommodates larger patients, and offers excellent access to the operated site thanks to its design and adjustment options</li>\r\n 	<li>Compact and durable</li>\r\n 	<li>Cost effective with high quality</li>\r\n 	<li>Heavy-duty casters with low noise and high mobility</li>\r\n 	<li>Reliable hydraulic systems for a steady and swift lifting up/down</li>\r\n 	<li>Integrated Kidney elevator</li>\r\n 	<li>Dual-layer slow-elastic memory foam pad</li>\r\n 	<li>More comfort and balance stress</li>\r\n 	<li>Orthopaedic tractor and skull clamp as optional</li>\r\n 	<li>Table board is radiolucent with X-ray film cassette</li>\r\n</ul>\";s:6:\"filter\";s:1:\"1\";s:6:\"visual\";s:1:\"1\";}}}}',1216,'http://www.ig-medical.com/2017/11/10/1216-revision-v1/',0,'revision','',0),(1936,1,'2017-11-10 16:58:49','2017-11-10 15:58:49','\n\n\n\nKurze Zusammenfassung\n\n<img width=\"3484\" height=\"1348\" src=\"http://www.ig-medical.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/11/LAM.png\" />				\n\n<!-- .container -->\n								 <!-- .overlay -->\n\nLAM LED Series			the surgical lights of our LAM Series With advanced LED technology provide excellent illumination,with long service life, giving you fully support in OR.\n streamline slim design is optimized for laminar flow including manual and electronic light field adjustment for homogenous light in surgery area\n Variable colour temperature for the perception of true tissue colours\n\n<a href=\"http://www.ig-medical.com/startseite/surgicallighting/lam-led-series/\">\n							<img width=\"1784\" height=\"1160\" src=\"http://www.ig-medical.com/wp-