lic systems for a steady and swift lifting up/down\nIntegrated Kidney elevator\nDual-layer slow-elastic memory foam pad\nMore comfort and balance stress\nOrthopaedic tractor and skull clamp as optional\nTable board is radiolucent with X-ray film cassette\n\n','Manual','','inherit','closed','closed','','1216-revision-v1','','','2017-11-10 17:09:12','2017-11-10 16:09:12','a:4:{s:7:\"post_id\";i:1216;s:9:\"post_hash\";s:44:\"layers_page_f626ef453c43a29737ffc4262e616399\";s:10:\"post_title\";s:6:\"Manual\";s:11:\"widget_data\";a:1:{s:24:\"obox-layers-builder-1216\";a:2:{s:14:\"media_image-10\";a:15:{s:13:\"attachment_id\";s:3:\"559\";s:3:\"url\";s:75:\"http://www.ig-medical.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/tab-manual-300x190.jpg\";s:5:\"title\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"size\";s:6:\"medium\";s:5:\"width\";s:3:\"511\";s:6:\"height\";s:3:\"323\";s:7:\"caption\";s:0:\"\";s:3:\"alt\";s:0:\"\";s:9:\"link_type\";s:4:\"none\";s:8:\"link_url\";s:0:\"\";s:13:\"image_classes\";s:0:\"\";s:12:\"link_classes\";s:0:\"\";s:8:\"link_rel\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"link_target_blank\";s:0:\"\";s:11:\"image_title\";s:0:\"\";}s:7:\"text-27\";a:4:{s:5:\"title\";s:29:\"TAB Series - Manual hydraulic\";s:4:\"text\";s:707:\"<ul>\r\n 	<li>Enables a wide range of configurations for general and special surgery</li>\r\n 	<li>Accommodates larger patients, and offers excellent access to the operated site thanks to its design and adjustment options</li>\r\n 	<li>Compact and durable</li>\r\n 	<li>Cost effective with high quality</li>\r\n 	<li>Heavy-duty casters with low noise and high mobility</li>\r\n 	<li>Reliable hydraulic systems for a steady and swift lifting up/down</li>\r\n 	<li>Integrated Kidney elevator</li>\r\n 	<li>Dual-layer slow-elastic memory foam pad</li>\r\n 	<li>More comfort and balance stress</li>\r\n 	<li>Orthopaedic tractor and skull clamp as optional</li>\r\n 	<li>Table board is radiolucent with X-ray film cassette</li>\r\n</ul>\";s:6:\"filter\";s:1:\"1\";s:6:\"visual\";s:1:\"1\";}}}}',1216,'http://www.