oof, stain resistant, anti static and easy cleaning</li>\r\n 	<li>High strength image-compatible table board</li>\r\n</ul>\";s:6:\"filter\";s:1:\"1\";s:6:\"visual\";s:1:\"1\";}}}}',1220,'http://www.ig-medical.com/2017/11/10/1220-revision-v1/',0,'revision','',0),(2051,1,'2017-11-10 17:25:45','2017-11-10 16:25:45','\n\n\n\n<a href=\"#more\">\n\nTAB Series - Electro-hydraulic														\n\n<img width=\"10005\" height=\"9216\" src=\"http://www.ig-medical.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/Electro-hydraulic-VG.png\" />				\n\n<!-- .container -->\n								 <!-- .overlay -->\n\n</a>\n\nProduct features:			\nHigh quality stainless steel body: Durable and corrosion resistant\nLoad capacity: Up to 500kgs\nTable top sliding range up to 500mm\nKidney elevator: 120mm\nLow-setting table system to achieve comfort operating\nMulti-layer memory foam: Water proof, antibacterial and antistatic\nIntelligent battery management system\nTwo independent controlling systems\nHandheld controller / wireless controller / emergency panel\nEmergency override controlling system\nWide range of accessories\n\nOptional: Carbon fibre plate\n\n','Electro-hydraulic','','inherit','closed','closed','','1218-revision-v1','','','2017-11-10 17:25:45','2017-11-10 16:25:45','a:4:{s:7:\"post_id\";i:1218;s:9:\"post_hash\";s:44:\"layers_page_8bb155753f7c9e432397584252df3487\";s:10:\"post_title\";s:17:\"Electro-hydraulic\";s:11:\"widget_data\";a:1:{s:24:\"obox-layers-builder-1218\";a:2:{s:22:\"layers-widget-slide-24\";a:14:{s:26:\"autoheight_slides-CHECKBOX\";s:2:\"on\";s:12:\"slide_height\";s:3:\"550\";s:6:\"design\";a:1:{s:8:\"advanced\";a:5:{s:7:\"padding\";a:4:{s:3:\"top\";s:0:\"\";s:5:\"right\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"bottom\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"left\";s:0:\"\";}s:6:\"margin\";a:4:{s:3:\"top\";s:0:\"\";s:5:\"right\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"bottom\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"left\";s:0:\"\";}s:6:\"anchor\";s:0:\"\";s:11:\"customclass\";s:0:\"\";s:9:\"customcss\";s:0:\"\";}}s:18:\"show_slider_arrows\";s:2:\"on\";s:27:\"show_slider_arrows-CHECK