ng 12-channel ECG analysis</li>\r\n 	<li>High storage capacity:\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Up to 2 hours single-channel ECG data storage</li>\r\n 	<li>Up to 480h trend/graphic storage and review</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n 	<li>S-T segment anylisis and &gt;23 tpyes of arrhythmia analysis</li>\r\n 	<li>Suitable for adult, peadiatric and neonate patients</li>\r\n 	<li>Easy drug calculation interface</li>\r\n 	<li>Defibrillator discharge protection</li>\r\n 	<li>Bed to bed view for comfortable patient visit</li>\r\n 	<li>Visual and audible alarms</li>\r\n 	<li>Rechargeable and exchangeable batteries( up to 10 hours working time)</li>\r\n</ul>\";s:6:\"filter\";s:1:\"1\";s:6:\"visual\";s:1:\"1\";}}}}',189,'http://www.ig-medical.com/2017/11/10/189-revision-v1/',0,'revision','',0),(2317,1,'2017-11-10 18:08:43','2017-11-10 17:08:43','\n\nImpressum								\n																						International Group medical technology and electronics GmbH\n\nEllhornstraße 12/1428195 Bremen, GermanyP: +49 (0) 421 / 8478 8804F: +49 (0) 421 / 5956 4661E: info@ig-medical.de\n\nLegal information:																											\n																																					Ust IdNr: De278597848HRB 27212 Amtsgericht BremenCEO: Dipl. Ing. Shedid\n\n<!-- /row -->\n\n','Impressum','','inherit','closed','closed','','163-revision-v1','','','2017-11-10 18:08:43','2017-11-10 17:08:43','a:4:{s:7:\"post_id\";i:163;s:9:\"post_hash\";s:44:\"layers_page_eb37352598c28a52709c6daa01c92652\";s:10:\"post_title\";s:9:\"Impressum\";s:11:\"widget_data\";a:1:{s:23:\"obox-layers-builder-163\";a:1:{s:22:\"layers-widget-column-6\";a:5:{s:6:\"design\";a:7:{s:6:\"layout\";s:12:\"layout-boxed\";s:8:\"advanced\";a:5:{s:7:\"padding\";a:4:{s:3:\"top\";s:0:\"\";s:5:\"right\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"bottom\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"left\";s:0:\"\";}s:6:\"margin\";a:4:{s:3:\"top\";s:0:\"\";s:5:\"right\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"bottom\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"left\";s:0:\"\";}s:6:\"anchor\";s:0:\"\";s:11:\"customclass\";s:0:\"\";s:9:\"customcss\";s:0:\"\";}s:9:\"liststyle\";s:9:\"list-grid