 .overlay -->\n\n</a>\n\nProduct features:			Based on a plug-and-play modular structure, monitoring functions can be quickly adjusted according to your specific clinical requirements. An intuitive interface with configurable user modes and easy to use functions helps you to save time and improve overall patient care.\n&nbsp;\n\nHigh resolution TFT touch screen display with auto screen layout\nCan display up to 13 parameters at once\nResting 12-channel ECG analysis\nHigh storage capacity:\n\nUp to 2 hours single-channel ECG data storage\nUp to 480h trend/graphic storage and review\n\nS-T segment anylisis and &gt;23 tpyes of arrhythmia analysis\nSuitable for adult, peadiatric and neonate patients\nEasy drug calculation interface\nDefibrillator discharge protection\nBed to bed view for comfortable patient visit\nVisual and audible alarms\nRechargeable and exchangeable batteries( up to 10 hours working time)\n\n','Modular','','inherit','closed','closed','','187-revision-v1','','','2017-11-10 18:27:32','2017-11-10 17:27:32','a:4:{s:7:\"post_id\";i:187;s:9:\"post_hash\";s:44:\"layers_page_346c6dc7d426321b05f37a502d0c7d14\";s:10:\"post_title\";s:7:\"Modular\";s:11:\"widget_data\";a:1:{s:23:\"obox-layers-builder-187\";a:2:{s:22:\"layers-widget-slide-36\";a:14:{s:26:\"autoheight_slides-CHECKBOX\";s:2:\"on\";s:12:\"slide_height\";s:3:\"550\";s:6:\"design\";a:1:{s:8:\"advanced\";a:5:{s:7:\"padding\";a:4:{s:3:\"top\";s:0:\"\";s:5:\"right\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"bottom\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"left\";s:0:\"\";}s:6:\"margin\";a:4:{s:3:\"top\";s:0:\"\";s:5:\"right\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"bottom\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"left\";s:0:\"\";}s:6:\"anchor\";s:0:\"\";s:11:\"customclass\";s:0:\"\";s:9:\"customcss\";s:0:\"\";}}s:18:\"show_slider_arrows\";s:2:\"on\";s:27:\"show_slider_arrows-CHECKBOX\";s:2:\"on\";s:16:\"show_slider_dots\";s:2:\"on\";s:25:\"show_slider_dots-CHECKBOX\";s:2:\"on\";s:18:\"slider_arrow_color\";s:0:\"\";s:14:\"animation_type\";s:5:\"slide\";s:24:\"autoplay_slides-CHECKBOX\";s:2:\"on\";s:10:\"s