12:\"show_address\";s:2:\"on\";s:21:\"show_address-CHECKBOX\";s:2:\"on\";s:17:\"show_contact_form\";s:2:\"on\";s:26:\"show_contact_form-CHECKBOX\";s:2:\"on\";s:5:\"title\";s:12:\"Our location\";s:7:\"excerpt\";s:70:\"<p style=\"\">We are located in the heart of Bremen city in Germany.</p>\";s:20:\"google_maps_location\";s:34:\"Ellhornstraße 12 /14 28195 Bremen\";s:20:\"google_maps_long_lat\";s:0:\"\";s:13:\"address_shown\";s:0:\"\";s:12:\"contact_form\";s:0:\"\";}}}}',25,'http://www.ig-medical.com/2017/11/10/25-revision-v1/',0,'revision','',0),(2515,1,'2017-11-10 18:31:35','2017-11-10 17:31:35','<p class=\"style10\">The International Group medical technology and electronics GmbH,  located in Bremen-Germany is dedicated to develope, manufacture and distribute: Innovative, high performance and efficient medical equipment. .</p>\nIt is our mission to facilitate the work of doctors and care personnel as well as establish long-term esteeming relationships with our customers.\n\n&nbsp;\n\nOur products are marked by outstanding quality and maximum reliability. These are features that, while striving to reach perfection, we continue to optimize through an ongoing process of innovation.\n\n&nbsp;\n\nIn the field of medical technology and equipment, where the life and wellbeing of patient is at stake, quality and reliability is imperative. Patients, users and retailers can rely on the experience and expert knowledge of the IG team.\n\n&nbsp;\n\nThe international team of doctors and engineers is working hard on the research, development, manufacture, and sales of medical equipment and have recourse to over 20 years of experience and technical knowledge. Developing new products we take the needs and feedback of users, i.e. doctors and care personnel, into account, in addition to our technical knowhow.\n\n&nbsp;\n\nMultiple costumers of IG GmbH are already convinced of the exceptional quality of our products. Currently we have established a network of costumers in many countries on various continents. In the pursuit of expanding this network we focus on long-term business relations.\n\n&nbsp;\n\nOur Mission is it to provide medical equipment and technology\n<ul>\n 	<li>- of the highest quality</li>\n 	<li>- with maximum user friendliness</li>\n 	<li>- at affordable costs</li>\n 	<li>- through consistent costumer relations</li>\n</ul>\n&nbsp;\n\nAt the moment our group consist of three members:\n<ul>\n 	<li><strong>Operating-room and ICU equipment (<a href=\"http://www.ig-medical.de\">IG Medical</a>):</strong>\nPatient monitors\nECG machines\nElectrosurgical generators\nSurgical lighting\nOperating tables</li>\n 	<li><strong>Gastroenterology (<a href=\"http://www.endocure.de\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Endocure</a>):</strong>\nFull range of flexible endoscopic accessories\nElectro-Gastro-Graphs. (E.G.G.)\nCapsule Endoscope Systems</li>\n 	<li><strong>Diagnostic equipment (<a href=\"http://www.ig-technology.de\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">IG Technology</a>):</strong>\nInnovative and cost-effective diagnostic technology</li>\n</ul>\n&nbsp;\n<p class=\"style10\"><strong>Our company International group medical technology and electronics GmbH as well as our products are ISO 13485:2012 and CE certified according to respective requirements in the European directive 93/42/ EEC concerning medical devices which apply to it. </strong></p>\n&nbsp;','About us','','inherit','closed','closed','','1277-autosave-v1','','','2017-11-10 18:31:35','2017-11-10 17:31:35','',1277,'http://www.ig-medical.com/2017/11/10/1277-autosave-v1/',0,'revision','',0),(2517,1,'2017-11-10 18:32:41','2017-11-10 17:32:41','<p class=\"style10\">The International Group medical technology and electronics GmbH,  located in Bremen-Germany is dedicated to develope, manufacture and distribute: Innovative, high performance and efficient medical equipment. .</p>\r\nIt is our mission to facilitate the work of doctors and care personnel as well as establish long-term esteeming relationships with our customers.\r\n\r\nOur products are marked by outstanding quality and maximum reliability. These are features that, while striving to reach perfection, we continue to optimize through an ongoing process of innovation.\r\n\r\nIn the field of medical technology and equipment, where the life and wellbeing of patient is at stake, quality and reliability is imperative. Patients, users and retailers can rely on the experience and expert knowledge of the IG team.\r\n\r\nThe international team of doctors and engineers is working hard on the research, development, manufacture, and sales of medical equipment and have recourse to over 20 years of experience and technical knowledge. Developing new products we take the needs and feedback of users, i.e. doctors and care personnel, into account, in addition to our technical knowhow.\r\n\r\nMultiple costumers are already convinced of the exceptional quality of our products. Currently we have established a network of costumers in many countries on various continents. In the pursuit of expanding this network we focus on long-term business relations.\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\nAt the moment we can provide three product ranges:\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li><strong>Operating-room and ICU equipment (<a href=\"http://www.ig-medical.de\">IG Medical</a>):</strong>\r\nPatient monitors\r\nECG machines\r\nElectrosurgical generators\r\nSurgical lighting\r\nOperating tables</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Gastroenterology (<a href=\"http://www.endocure.de\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Endocure</a>):</strong>\r\nFull range of flexible endoscopic accessories\r\nElectro-Gastro-Graphs. (E.G.G.)\r\nCapsule Endoscope Systems</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Diagnostic equipment (<a href=\"http://www.ig-technology.de\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">IG Technology</a>):</strong>\r\nInnovative and cost-effective diagnostic technology</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n&nbsp;\r\n<p class=\"style10\"><strong>Our company International group medical technology and electronics GmbH as well as our products are ISO 13485:2012 and CE certified according to respective requirements in the European directive 93/42/ EEC concerning medical devices which apply to it. </strong></p>\r\n&nbsp;','About us','','inherit','closed','closed','','1277-revision-v1','','','2017-11-10 18:32:41','2017-11-10 17:32:41','',1277,'http://www.ig-medical.com/2017/11/10/1277-revision-v1/',0,'revision','',0),(2518,1,'2017-11-10 18:33:25','2017-11-10 17:33:25','','About us','','inherit','closed','closed','','1277-revision-v1','','','2017-11-10 18:33:25','2017-11-10 17:33:25','',1277,'http://www.ig-medical.com/2017/11/10/1277-revision-v1/',0,'revision','',0),(2520,1,'2017-11-10 18:34:59','2017-11-10 17:34:59','\n\n\n\n<a href=\"#more\">\n\nLAM LED Series														\n\n<img width=\"1784\" height=\"1160\" src=\"http://www.ig-medical.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/11/LAM-LED-II-.jpg\" />				\n\n<!-- .container -->\n								 <!-- .overlay -->\n\n</a>\n\nProduct features:			\nUltrathin / compact design\nStable optical performance and shadow less lighting\nAdjustable illumination up to 160Klux\nProfessional MIS Endo mode (green/white)\nColor temperature adjustable\nDual controlling system with touch screen\nElectric and manual focusing\nUp t0 60,000h effective working life\nAdvanced energy control system\nLow power consumption\nOptional features: HD camera, wall control panel, TFT monitor\nModels: Sealing, wall, mobile type with battery system\n\n<img width=\"186\" height=\"300\" src=\"http://www.ig-medical.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/11/LAM-LED-Mobile-186x300.jpg\" /><img width=\"300\" height=\"168\" src=\"http://www.ig-medical.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/11/LAM-LED-III-300x168.jpg\" /><img width=\"253\" height=\"300\" src=\"http://www.ig-medical.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/11/LAM-LED-II-TRANS-2-1-253x300.png\" />','LAM LED Series','','inherit','closed','closed','','1734-revision-v1','','','2017-11-10 18:34:59','2017-11-10 17:34:59','a:4:{s:7:\"post_id\";i:1734;s:9:\"post_hash\"