les			IG medical markets and sells medical devices equipment and products worldwide.\nIn most cases IG medical uses multiple national and international distributors&#8216; channels depending on the particular market conditions: pricing, regulatory requirements, tenders, availability of distributors, brand name awareness, etc.\nIf you wish further information please use our contact form or send us an email to: <a href=\"mailto:info@ig-medical.de\">info@ig-medical.de</a>\n\n<!-- /row -->\n\nProduct service			Our service team would like provide information relating to order processing, complaint or agreement on technical details of our products.\n\nPlease do not hesitate to contact us at <a href=\"mailto:support@ig-medical.de\">support@ig-medical.de</a>. We shall process your request immediately.\nCompetent, individual consulting and error diagnosis is a matter of course.\n\n','Sales and service','','inherit','closed','closed','','1694-revision-v1','','','2017-11-10 18:49:31','2017-11-10 17:49:31','a:4:{s:7:\"post_id\";i:1694;s:9:\"post_hash\";s:44:\"layers_page_bf8ad666af6fba0da61027ba088b1826\";s:10:\"post_title\";s:17:\"Sales and service\";s:11:\"widget_data\";a:1:{s:24:\"obox-layers-builder-1694\";a:4:{s:22:\"layers-widget-slide-17\";a:14:{s:26:\"autoheight_slides-CHECKBOX\";s:2:\"on\";s:12:\"slide_height\";s:3:\"550\";s:6:\"design\";a:1:{s:8:\"advanced\";a:5:{s:7:\"padding\";a:4:{s:3:\"top\";s:0:\"\";s:5:\"right\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"bottom\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"left\";s:0:\"\";}s:6:\"margin\";a:4:{s:3:\"top\";s:0:\"\";s:5:\"right\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"bottom\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"left\";s:0:\"\";}s:6:\"anchor\";s:0:\"\";s:11:\"customclass\";s:0:\"\";s:9:\"customcss\";s:0:\"\";}}s:18:\"show_slider_arrows\";s:2:\"on\";s:27:\"show_slider_arrows-CHECKBOX\";s:2:\"on\";s:16:\"show_slider_dots\";s:2:\"on\";s:25:\"show_slider_dots-CHECKBOX\";s:2:\"on\";s:18:\"slider_arrow_color\";s:0:\"\";s:14:\"animation_type\";s:5:\"slide\";s:24:\"autoplay_slides-CHECKBOX\";s:2:\"on\";s:10:\"slide_time\";