Title\";s:7:\"excerpt\";s:28:\"<p>Kurze Zusammenfassung</p>\";s:6:\"button\";a:6:{s:9:\"link_type\";s:6:\"custom\";s:16:\"link_type_custom\";s:5:\"#more\";s:14:\"link_type_post\";s:0:\"\";s:27:\"link_type_post_type_archive\";s:0:\"\";s:26:\"link_type_taxonomy_archive\";s:0:\"\";s:9:\"link_text\";s:8:\"See More\";}}}}s:7:\"text-17\";a:4:{s:5:\"title\";s:7:\"Quality\";s:4:\"text\";s:338:\"As a leading manufacturer of medical technology and electronics, we provide our customers first-class quality and excellent products.\r\n\r\nOur company IG GmbH as well as our products are ISO 13485:2012 and CE certified  according to respective requirements in the European directive 93/42/ EEC concerning medical devices which apply to it.\";s:6:\"filter\";s:1:\"1\";s:6:\"visual\";s:1:\"1\";}s:14:\"media_image-16\";a:15:{s:13:\"attachment_id\";s:4:\"2383\";s:3:\"url\";s:69:\"http://www.ig-medical.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/11/Certificates.png\";s:5:\"title\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"size\";s:4:\"full\";s:5:\"width\";s:4:\"1393\";s:6:\"height\";s:3:\"649\";s:7:\"caption\";s:0:\"\";s:3:\"alt\";s:0:\"\";s:9:\"link_type\";s:4:\"none\";s:8:\"link_url\";s:0:\"\";s:13:\"image_classes\";s:0:\"\";s:12:\"link_classes\";s:0:\"\";s:8:\"link_rel\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"link_target_blank\";s:0:\"\";s:11:\"image_title\";s:0:\"\";}}}}',1679,'http://www.ig-medical.com/2017/11/10/1679-revision-v1/',0,'revision','',0),(2604,1,'2017-11-10 18:54:24','2017-11-10 17:54:24','\n\n\n\n<a href=\"#more\">\n\n<img width=\"1973\" height=\"1285\" src=\"http://www.ig-medical.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/08/IG-International-Group-medical-technology-and-electronics-GmbH.png\" />				\n\n<!-- .container -->\n								 <!-- .overlay -->\n\n</a>\n\nInternational group medical technology and electronics GmbH			The International Group medical technology and electronics GmbH,  located in Bremen-Germany is dedicated to develope, manufacture and distribute: Innovative, high performance and efficient medical equipment.\n&nbsp;\nIt is our mission to facilitate the work of doctors and care personnel as well as establish long-term esteeming relationships with our customers.\nOur products are marked by outstanding quality and maximum reliability. These are features that, while striving to reach perfection, we continue to optimize through an ongoing process of innovation.\n&nbsp;\nIn the field of medical technology and equipment, where the life and wellbeing of patient is at stake, quality and reliability is imperative. Patients, users and retailers can rely on the experience and expert knowledge of the IG team.\n&nbsp;\nThe international team of doctors and engineers is working hard on the research, development, manufacture, and sales of medical equipment and have recourse to over 20 years of experience and technical knowledge. Developing new products we take the needs and feedback of users, i.e. doctors and care personnel, into account, in addition to our technical knowhow.\n&nbsp;\nMultiple costumers are already convinced of the exceptional quality of our products. Currently we have established a network of costumers in many countries on various continents. In the pursuit of expanding this network we focus on long-term business relations.\n&nbsp;\n&nbsp;\nAt the moment we can provide three product ranges:\n\nOperating-room and ICU equipment (<a href=\"http://www.ig-medical.de\">IG Medical</a>):\nPatient monitors\nECG machines\nElectrosurgical generators\nSurgical lighting\nOperating tables\nGastroenterology (<a href=\"http://www.endocure.de\" target=\"_blank\">Endocure</a>):\nFull range of flexible endoscopic accessories\nElectro-Gastro-Graphs. (E.G.G.)\nCapsule Endoscope Systems\nDiagnostic equipment (<a href=\"http://www.ig-technology.de\" target=\"_blank\">IG Technology</a>):\nInnovative and cost-effective diagnostic technology\n\n&nbsp;\nOur company International group medical technology and electronics GmbH as well as our products are ISO 13485:2012 and CE certified according to respective requirements in the European directive 93/42/ EEC concerning medical devices which apply to it. \n&nbsp;\n\n<img width=\"300\" height=\"127\" src=\"http://www.ig-medical.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/11/TÜV-300x127.png\" />','About us','','inherit','closed','closed','','1277-revision-v1','','','2017-11-10 18:54:24','2017-11-10 17:54:24','a:4:{s:7:\"post_id\";i:1277;s:9:\"post_hash\";s:44:\"layers_page_20ab8b58604b44b3799801fe463625b9\";s:10:\"post_title\";s:8:\"About us\";s:11:\"widget_data\";a:1:{s:24:\"obox-layers-builder-1277\";a:3:{s:22:\"layers-widget-slide-46\";a:14:{s:26:\"autoheight_slides-CHECKBOX\";s:2:\"on\";s:12:\"slide_height\";s:3:\"550\";s:6:\"design\";a:1:{s:8:\"advanced\";a:5:{s:7:\"padding\";a:4:{s:3:\"top\";s:0:\"\";s:5:\"right\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"bottom\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"left\";s:0:\"\";}s:6:\"margin\";a:4:{s:3:\"top\";s:0:\"\";s:5:\"right\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"bottom\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"left\";s:0:\"\";}s:6:\"anchor\";s:0:\"\";s:11:\"customclass\";s:0:\"\";s:9:\"customcss\";s:0:\"\";}}s:18:\"show_slider_arrows\";s:2:\"on\";s:27:\"show_slider_arrows-CHECKBOX\";s:2:\"on\";s:16:\"show_slider_dots\";s:2:\"on\";s:25:\"show_slider_dots-CHECKBOX\";s:2:\"on\";s:18:\"slider_arrow_color\";s:0:\"\";s:14:\"animation_type\";s:5:\"slide\";s:24:\"autoplay_slides-CHECKBOX\";s:2:\"on\";s:10:\"slide_time\";s:0:\"\";s:11:\"focus_slide\";s:1:\"1\";s:9:\"slide_ids\";s:2:\"93\";s:6:\"slides\";a:1:{i:93;a:4:{s:6:\"design\";a:6:{s:10:\"background\";a:6:{s:5:\"color\";s:7:\"#f8f8f8\";s:5:\"image\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"repeat\";s:9:\"no-repeat\";s:8:\"position\";s:6:\"center\";s:16:\"stretch-CHECKBOX\";s:2:\"on\";s:15:\"darken-CHECKBOX\";s:2:\"on\";}s:13:\"featuredimage\";s:119:\"http://www.ig-medical.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/08/IG-International-Group-medical-technology-and-electronics-GmbH.png\";s:13:\"featuredvideo\";s:0:\"\";s:10:\"imagealign\";s:9:\"image-top\";s:5:\"fonts\";a:4:{s:4:\"size\";s:5:\"large\";s:5:\"align\";s:11:\"text-center\";s:5:\"color\";s:0:\"\";s:13:\"excerpt-color\";s:0:\"\";}s:8:\"advanced\";a:1:{s:11:\"customclass\";s:0:\"\";}}s:5:\"title\";s:0:\"\";s:7:\"excerpt\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"button\";a:6:{s:9:\"link_type\";s:6:\"custom\";s:16:\"link_type_custom\";s:5:\"#more\";s:14:\"link_type_post\";s:0:\"\";s:27:\"link_type_post_type_archive\";s:0:\"\";s:26:\"link_type_taxonomy_archive\";s:0:\"\";s:9:\"link_text\";s:0:\"\";}}}}s:7:\"text-48\";a:4:{s:5:\"title\";s:59:\"International group medical technology and electronics GmbH\";s:4:\"text\";s:2541:\"<p class=\"style10\">The International Group medical technology and electronics GmbH,  located in Bremen-Germany is dedicated to develope, manufacture and distribute: Innovative, high performance and efficient medical equipment.</p>\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\nIt is our mission to facilitate the work of doctors and care personnel as well as establish long-term esteeming relationships with our customers.\r\n\r\nOur products are marked by outstanding quality and maximum reliability. These are features that, while striving to reach perfection, we continue to optimize through an ongoing process of innovation.\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\nIn the field of medical technology and equipment, where the life and wellbeing of patient is at stake, quality and reliability is imperative. Patients, users and retailers can rely on the experience and expert knowledge of the IG team.\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\nThe international team of doctors and engineers is working hard on the research, development, manufacture, and sales of medical equipment and have recourse to over 20 years of experience and technical knowledge. Developing new products we take the needs and feedback of users, i.e. doctors and care personnel, into account, in addition to our technical knowhow.\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\nMultiple costumers are already convinced of the exceptional quality of our products. Currently we have established a network of costumers in many countries on various continents. In the pursuit of expanding this network we focus on long-term business relations.\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n<strong>At the moment we can provide three product ranges</strong>:\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li><strong>Operating-room and ICU equipment (<a href=\"http://www.ig-medical.de\">IG Medical</a>):</strong>\r\nPatient monitors\r\nECG machines\r\nElectrosurgical generators\r\nSurgical lighting\r\nOperating tables</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Gastroenterology (<a href=\"http://www.endocure.de\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Endocure</a>):</strong>\r\nFull range of flexible endoscopic accessories\r\nElectro-Gastro-Graphs. (E.G.G.)\r\nCapsule Endoscope Systems</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Diagnostic equipment (<a href=\"http://www.ig-technology.de\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">IG Technology</a>):</strong>\r\nInnovative and cost-effective diagnostic technology</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n&nbsp;\r\n<p class=\"style10\"><strong>Our company International group medical technology and electronics GmbH as well as our products are ISO 13485:2012 and CE certified according to respective requirements in the European directive 93/42/ EEC concerning medical devices which apply to it. </strong></p>\r\n&nbsp;\";s:6:\"filter\";s:1:\"1\";s:6:\"visual\";s:1:\"1\";}s:14:\"media_image-19\";a:15:{s:13:\"attachment_id\";s:4:\"2580\";s:3:\"url\";s:69:\"http://www.ig-medical.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/11/TÜV-300x127.png\";s:5:\"title\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"size\";s:6:\"medium\";s:5:\"width\";s:3:\"881\";s:6:\"height\";s:3:\"373\";s:7:\"caption\";s:0:\"\";s:3:\"alt\";s:0:\"\";s:9:\"link_type\";s:4:\"none\";s:8:\"link_url\";s:0:\"\";s:13:\"image_classes\";s:0:\"\";s:12:\"link_classes\";s:0:\"\";s:8:\"link_rel\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"link_target_blank\";s:0:\"\";s:11:\"image_title\";s:0:\"\";}}}}',1277,'http://www.ig-medical.com/2017/11/10/1277-revision-v1/',0,'revision','',0),(2606,1,'2017-11-10 18:54:25','2017-11-10 17:54:25','\n\n\n\n<a href=\"#more\">\n\nTAB Series - Electric														\n\n<img width=\"661\" height=\"357\" src=\"http://www.ig-medical.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/tab-electro-hydraulic.jpg\" />				\n\n<!-- .container -->\n								 <!-- .overlay -->\n\n</a>\n\nXP Series &#8211; Electric			&lt;ul style=&quot;list-style-type:circle;&#8220;&gt;\nMobile operating table represents convenient design and maximum flexibility for general surgery\nIts modular construction with a wide range of posture possibilities offers comfort and operational efficiency for the whole surgical team\nWith the comprehensive selection of accessories the table can be adjusted to meet most requirements for different surgical procedures\nElectric motor(actuator)\nReliable and easy maintenance\nNo oil leakage and low noise\nFully electric controlled with position sensor\nEasy operation with &#8222;Reset&#8220;, &#8222;Flex&#8220; and &#8222;Re-flex2 button\nEasy to move and lock firmly\nEasy cleaning and anti-bacteria\nIntegrated kidney elevator\nBuild-in back up battery\nMulti-layer memory foam pad with PU cover\nHigh frequency welding\nWater proof, stain resistant, anti static and easy cleaning\nHigh strength image-compatible table board\n\n','Electric table','','inherit','closed','closed','','1220-revision-v1','','','2017-11-10 18:54:25','2017-11-10 17:54:25','a:4:{s:7:\"post_id\";i:1220;s:9:\"post_hash\";s:44:\"layers_page_ca14ca028a81fbcd89e9c7cf170638fa\";s:10:\"post_title\";s:14:\"Electric table\";s:11:\"widget_data\";a:1:{s:24:\"obox-layers-builder-1220\";a:2:{s:22:\"layers-widget-slide-26\";a:14:{s:26:\"autoheight_slides-CHECKBOX\";s:2:\"on\";s:12:\"slide_height\";s:3:\"550\";s:6:\"design\";a:1:{s:8:\"advanced\";a:5:{s:7:\"padding\";a:4:{s:3:\"top\";s:0:\"\";s:5:\"right\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"bottom\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"left\";s:0:\"\";}s:6:\"margin\";a:4:{s:3:\"top\";s:0:\"\";s:5:\"right\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"bottom\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"left\";s:0:\"\";}s:6:\"anchor\";s:0:\"\";s:11:\"customclass\";s:0:\"\";s:9:\"customcss\";s:0:\"\";}}s:18:\"show_slider_arrows\";s:2:\"on\";s:27:\"show_slider_arrows-CHECKBOX\";s:2:\"on\";s:16:\"show_slider_dots\";s:2:\"on\";s:25:\"show_slider_dots-CHECKBOX\";s:2:\"on\";s:18:\"slider_arrow_color\";s:0:\"\";s:14:\"animation_type\";s:5:\"slide\";s:24:\"autoplay_slides-CHECKBOX\";s:2:\"on\";s:10:\"slide_time\";s:0:\"\";s:11:\"focus_slide\";s:1:\"0\";s:9:\"slide_ids\";s:2:\"23\";s:6:\"slides\";a:1:{i:23;a:4:{s:6:\"design\";a:6:{s:10:\"background\";a:6:{s:5:\"color\";s:7:\"#f8f8f8\";s:5:\"image\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"repeat\";s:9:\"no-repeat\";s:8:\"position\";s:6:\"center\";s:16:\"stretch-CHECKBOX\";s:2:\"on\";s:15:\"darken-CHECKBOX\";s:2:\"on\";}s:13:\"featuredimage\";s:78:\"http://www.ig-medical.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/tab-electro-hydraulic.jpg\";s:13:\"featuredvideo\";s:0:\"\";s:10:\"imagealign\";s:9:\"image-top\";s:5:\"fonts\";a:4:{s:4:\"size\";s:5:\"large\";s:5:\"align\";s:11:\"text-center\";s:5:\"color\";s:0:\"\";s:13:\"excerpt-color\";s:0:\"\";}s:8:\"advanced\";a:1:{s:11:\"customclass\";s:0:\"\";}}s:5:\"title\";s:21:\"TAB Series - Electric\";s:7:\"excerpt\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"button\";a:6:{s:9:\"link_type\";s:6:\"custom\";s:16:\"link_type_custom\";s:5:\"#more\";s:14:\"link_type_post\";s:0:\"\";s:27:\"link_type_post_type_archive\";s:0:\"\";s:26:\"link_type_taxonomy_archive\";s:0:\"\";s:9:\"link_text\";s:0:\"\";}}}}s:7:\"text-25\";a:4:{s:5:\"title\";s:20:\"XP Series - Electric\";s:4:\"text\";s:1085:\"<ul style=\"list-style-type:circle<code></code>;\">\r\n 	<li>Mobile operating table represents convenient design and maximum flexibility for general surgery</li>\r\n 	<li>Its modular construction with a wide range of posture possibilities offers comfort and operational efficiency for the whole surgical team</li>\r\n 	<li>With the comprehensive selection of accessories the table can be adjusted to meet most requirements for different surgical procedures</li>\r\n 	<li>Electric motor(actuator)</li>\r\n 	<li>Reliable and easy maintenance</li>\r\n 	<li>No oil leakage and low noise</li>\r\n 	<li>Fully electric controlled with position sensor</li>\r\n 	<li>Easy operation with \"Reset\", \"Flex\" and \"Re-flex2 button</li>\r\n 	<li>Easy to move and lock firmly</li>\r\n 	<li>Easy cleaning and anti-bacteria</li>\r\n 	<li>Integrated kidney elevator</li>\r\n 	<li>Build-in back up battery</li>\r\n 	<li>Multi-layer memory foam pad with PU cover</li>\r\n 	<li>High frequency welding</li>\r\n 	<li>Water proof, stain resistant, anti static and easy cleaning</li>\r\n 	<li>High strength image-compatible table board</li>\r\n</ul>\";s:6:\"filter\";s:1:\"1\";s:6:\"visual\";s:1:\"1\";}}}}',1220,'http://www.ig-medical.com/2017/11/10/1220-revision-v1/',0,'revision','',0),(2607,1,'2017-11-10 18:54:25','2017-11-10 17:54:25','\n\n\n\n<a href=\"#more\">\n\nTAB Series - Electro-hydraulic														\n\n<img width=\"10005\" height=\"9216\" src=\"http://www.ig-medical.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/Electro-hydraulic-VG.png\" />				\n\n<!-- .container -->\n								 <!-- .overlay -->\n\n</a>\n\nProduct features:			\nHigh quality stainless steel body: Durable and corrosion resistant\nLoad capacity: Up to 500kgs\nTable top sliding range up to 500mm\nKidney elevator: 120mm\nLow-setting table system to achieve comfort operating\nMulti-layer memory foam: Water proof, antibacterial and antistatic\nIntelligent battery management system\nTwo independent controlling systems\nHandheld controller / wireless controller / emergency panel\nEmergency override controlling system\nWide range of accessories\n\nOptional: Carbon fibre plate\n\n','Electro-hydraulic','','inherit','closed','closed','','1218-revision-v1','','','2017-11-10 18:54:25','2017-11-10 17:54:25','a:4:{s:7:\"post_id\";i:1218;s:9:\"post_hash\";s:44:\"layers_page_8bb155753f7c9e432397584252df3487\";s:10:\"post_title\";s:17:\"Electro-hydraulic\";s:11:\"widget_data\";a:1:{s:24:\"obox-layers-builder-1218\";a:2:{s:22:\"layers-widget-slide-24\";a:14:{s:26:\"autoheight_slides-CHECKBOX\";s:2:\"on\";s:12:\"slide_height\";s:3:\"550\";s:6:\"design\";a:1:{s:8:\"advanced\";a:5:{s:7:\"padding\";a:4:{s:3:\"top\";s:0:\"\";s:5:\"right\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"bottom\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\