atient monitors are the optimal choice for acute care.Our plug-and-play modular model can be quickly adjusted according to your specific clinical requirements. An intuitive interface with configurable user modes and easy to use functions helps you to save time and improve overall patient care.														\n\n<img width=\"3671\" height=\"1262\" src=\"http://www.ig-medical.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/11/PM.png\" />				\n\n<!-- .container -->\n								 <!-- .overlay -->\n\n</a>\n\nXP Series			The patient monitors of the XP Series have been developed and designed to meet every clinical requirements and allowing to access data where and when ever they are needed. With their lightweight, powerful features and intuitive user interface, the XP Series patient monitors are the optimal choice for acute care.\n&nbsp;\nOur plug-and-play modular model can be quickly adjusted according to your specific clinical requirements. An intuitive interface with configurable user modes and easy to use functions helps you to save time and improve overall patient care.\n\n<a href=\"http://www.ig-medical.com/startseite/patient-monitors/modular/\" target=\"_blank\">\n							<img width=\"281\" height=\"300\" src=\"http://www.ig-medical.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/modular-281x300.jpg\" />						</a>\n\n<a href=\"http://www.ig-medical.com/startseite/patient-monitors/modular/\" target=\"_blank\">\n																													Modular																													</a>\n\n<a href=\"http://www.ig-medical.com/startseite/patient-monitors/compact/\">\n							<img width=\"300\" height=\"249\" src=\"http://www.ig-medical.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/11/XP-V-front-Number-change-300x249.png\" />						</a>\n\n<a href=\"http://www.ig-medical.com/startseite/patient-monitors/compact/\">\n																													Compact																													</a>\n\n<a href=\"http://www.ig-medical.com/startseite/patient-monitors/handheld/\">\n							<img width=\"252\" height=\"300\" src=\"http://www.ig-medical.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/Handheld-252x300.jpg\" />						</a>\n\n<a href=\"http://www.ig-medical.com/startseite/patient-monitors/handheld/\">\n																													Handheld Sp02/EtCo2																													</a>\n\n<!-- /row -->\n\n','Patient Monitors','','inherit','closed','closed','','191-revision-v1','','','2017-11-10 19:00:09','2017-11-10 18:00:09','a:4:{s:7:\"post_id\";i:191;s:9:\"post_hash\";s:44:\"layers_page_487a0c06e41180975a1798215f377832\";s:10:\"post_title\";s:16:\"Patient Monitors\";s:11:\"widget_data\";a:1:{s:23:\"obox-layers-builder-191\";a:3:{s:22:\"layers-widget-slide-11\";a:15:{s:6:\"design\";a:2:{s:6:\"layout\";s:16:\"layout-fullwidth\";s:8:\"advanced\";a:5:{s:7:\"padding\";a:4:{s:3:\"top\";s:0:\"\";s:5:\"right\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"bottom\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"left\";s:0:\"\";}s:6:\"margin\";a:4:{s:3:\"top\";s:0:\"\";s:5:\"right\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"bottom\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"left\";s:0:\"\";}s:6:\"anchor\";s:0:\"\";s:11:\"customclass\";s:0:\"\";s:9:\"customcss\";s:0:\"\";}}s:26:\"autoheight_slides-CHECKBOX\";s:2:\"on\";s:12:\"slide_height\";s:3:\"550\";s:18:\"show_slider_arrows\";s:2:\"on\";s:27:\"show_slider_arrows-CHECKBOX\";s:2:\"on\";s:16:\"show_slider_dots\";s:2:\"on\";s:25:\"show_slider_dots-CHECKBOX\";s:2:\"on\";s:18:\"slider_arrow_color\";s:7:\"#ba1f00\";s:14:\"animation_type\";s:8:\"parallax\";s:15:\"autoplay_slides\";s:2:\"on\";s:24:\"autoplay_slides-CHECKBOX\";s:2:\"on\";s:10:\"slide_time\";s:1:\"5\";s:11:\"focus_slide\";s:1:\"0\";s:9:\"slide_ids\";s:3:\"866\";s:6:\"slides\";a:1:{i:866;a:4:{s:6:\"design\";a:6:{s:10:\"background\";a:6:{s:5:\"color\";s:0:\"\";s:5:\"image\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"repeat\";s:9:\"no-repeat\";s:8:\"position\";s:6:\"center\";s:16:\"stretch-CHECKBOX\";s:2:\"on\";s:15:\"darken-CHECKBOX\";s:2:\"on\";}s:13:\"featuredimage\";s:59:\"http://www.ig-medical.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/11/PM.png\";s:13:\"featuredvideo\";s:0:\"\";s:10:\"imagealign\";s:9:\"image-top\";s:5:\"fonts\";a:4:{s:4:\"size\";s:5:\"large\";s:5:\"align\";s:11: