rdiac surgery\nand more\n\n&nbsp;\nOur MAX devices provide many efficient functions and modes:\nMonopolar cutting | Monopolar coagulation | Bipolar coagulation |  Bipolar cutting |  Endo cut | Vessel Sealing |Automatic compensation and memory setting  \n\n<a href=\"http://www.ig-medical.com/startseite/electrocardiograph/maxvi/\">\n							<img width=\"4021\" height=\"2533\" src=\"http://www.ig-medical.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/11/MAX-VI.png\" />						</a>\n\n<a href=\"http://www.ig-medical.com/startseite/electrocardiograph/maxvi/\">\n																													Touch screen																													</a>\n\n<a href=\"http://www.ig-medical.com/startseite/electrocardiograph/digital/\">\n							<img width=\"3485\" height=\"2191\" src=\"http://www.ig-medical.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/11/MAX-V.png\" />						</a>\n\n<a href=\"http://www.ig-medical.com/startseite/electrocardiograph/digital/\">\n																													Digital																													</a>\n\n<!-- /row -->\n\n','Electrosurgical unit','','inherit','closed','closed','','92-revision-v1','','','2017-11-10 19:03:01','2017-11-10 18:03:01','a:4:{s:7:\"post_id\";i:92;s:9:\"post_hash\";s:44:\"layers_page_535c44efa2d089b64125497ece6f351e\";s:10:\"post_title\";s:20:\"Electrosurgical unit\";s:11:\"widget_data\";a:1:{s:22:\"obox-layers-builder-92\";a:3:{s:22:\"layers-widget-slide-13\";a:15:{s:6:\"design\";a:2:{s:6:\"layout\";s:12:\"layout-boxed\";s:8:\"advanced\";a:5:{s:7:\"padding\";a:4:{s:3:\"top\";s:0:\"\";s:5:\"right\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"bottom\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"left\";s:0:\"\";}s:6:\"margin\";a:4:{s:3:\"top\";s:0:\"\";s:5:\"right\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"bottom\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"left\";s:0:\"\";}s:6:\"anchor\";s:0:\"\";s:11:\"customclass\";s:0:\"\";s:9:\"customcss\";s:0:\"\";}}s:26:\"autoheight_slides-CHECKBOX\";s:2:\"on\";s:12:\"slide_height\";s:3:\"550\";s:18:\"show_slider_arrows\";s:2:\"on\";s:27:\"show_slider_arrows-CHECKBOX\";s:2:\"on\";s:16:\"show_slider_dots\";s:2:\"on\";s:25:\"show_slider_dots-CHECKBOX\";s: