 \"Flex\" and \"Re-flex2 button</li>\r\n 	<li>Easy to move and lock firmly</li>\r\n 	<li>Easy cleaning and anti-bacteria</li>\r\n 	<li>Integrated kidney elevator</li>\r\n 	<li>Build-in back up battery</li>\r\n 	<li>Multi-layer memory foam pad with PU cover</li>\r\n 	<li>High frequency welding</li>\r\n 	<li>Water proof, stain resistant, anti static and easy cleaning</li>\r\n 	<li>High strength image-compatible table board</li>\r\n</ul>\";s:6:\"filter\";s:1:\"1\";s:6:\"visual\";s:1:\"1\";}}}}',1220,'http://www.ig-medical.com/2017/11/10/1220-revision-v1/',0,'revision','',0),(2818,1,'2017-11-10 19:20:23','2017-11-10 18:20:23','\n\n\n\n<a href=\"#more\">\n\nTAB Series - Electro-hydraulic														\n\n<img width=\"3642\" height=\"1244\" src=\"http://www.ig-medical.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/11/TAB.png\" />				\n\n<!-- .container -->\n								 <!-- .overlay -->\n\n</a>\n\nMAX Series - MAX V								\n\nUp to 400W output power, much more efficient than low frequency, produces less heat, not to mention sparkle, resulting in less burned tissue. Absolute output power at every mode of Coagulation, Blend, Bipolar like variable power of general ESU. Fast healing with excellent results.&nbsp;Provides smooth cuts with optimal performance on adipose tissues. It minimizes the carbonization and second bleeding by adhesion of the tissueComplex patient protect system for more safety2 Monopolar outputVarious CuttingCoagulationBipolar ModesSpray coagulation function\n\n<!-- /row -->\n\n','Electro-hydraulic','','inherit','closed','closed','','1218-revision-v1','','','2017-11-10 19:20:23','2017-11-10 18:20:23','a:4:{s:7:\"post_id\";i:1218;s:9:\"post_hash\";s:44:\"layers_page_8bb155753f7c9e432397584252df3487\";s:10:\"post_title\";s:17:\"Electro-hydraulic\";s:11:\"widget_data\";a:1:{s:24:\"obox-layers-builder-1218\";a:2:{s:22:\"layers-widget-slide-24\";a:15:{s:6:\"design\";a:2:{s:6:\"layout\";s:16:\"layout-fullwidth\";s:8:\"advanced\";a:5:{s:7:\"padding\";a:4:{s:3:\"top\";s:0:\"\";s:5:\"r