</li><li>Spray coagulation function</li></ul>\";s:6:\"button\";a:6:{s:9:\"link_type\";s:6:\"custom\";s:16:\"link_type_custom\";s:0:\"\";s:14:\"link_type_post\";s:0:\"\";s:27:\"link_type_post_type_archive\";s:0:\"\";s:26:\"link_type_taxonomy_archive\";s:0:\"\";s:9:\"link_text\";s:0:\"\";}}}}}}}',1218,'http://www.ig-medical.com/2017/11/10/1218-revision-v1/',0,'revision','',0),(2819,1,'2017-11-10 19:20:23','2017-11-10 18:20:23','\n\n\n\n<a href=\"#more\">\n\nTAB Series - Manual hydraulic														\n\n<img width=\"511\" height=\"323\" src=\"http://www.ig-medical.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/tab-manual.jpg\" />				\n\n<!-- .container -->\n								 <!-- .overlay -->\n\n</a>\n\nTAB Series &#8211; Manual hydraulic			\nEnables a wide range of configurations for general and special surgery\nAccommodates larger patients, and offers excellent access to the operated site thanks to its design and adjustment options\nCompact and durable\nCost effective with high quality\nHeavy-duty casters with low noise and high mobility\nReliable hydraulic systems for a steady and swift lifting up/down\nIntegrated Kidney elevator\nDual-layer slow-elastic memory foam pad\nMore comfort and balance stress\nOrthopaedic tractor and skull clamp as optional\nTable board is radiolucent with X-ray film cassette\n\n','Manual','','inherit','closed','closed','','1216-revision-v1','','','2017-11-10 19:20:23','2017-11-10 18:20:23','a:4:{s:7:\"post_id\";i:1216;s:9:\"post_hash\";s:44:\"layers_page_f626ef453c43a29737ffc4262e616399\";s:10:\"post_title\";s:6:\"Manual\";s:11:\"widget_data\";a:1:{s:24:\"obox-layers-builder-1216\";a:2:{s:22:\"layers-widget-slide-27\";a:14:{s:26:\"autoheight_slides-CHECKBOX\";s:2:\"on\";s:12:\"slide_height\";s:3:\"550\";s:6:\"design\";a:1:{s:8:\"advanced\";a:5:{s:7:\"padding\";a:4:{s:3:\"top\";s:0:\"\";s:5:\"right\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"bottom\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"left\";s:0:\"\";}s:6:\"margin\";a:4:{s:3:\"top\";s:0:\"\";s:5:\"right\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"bottom\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"left\";s:0:\"\"