 much more efficient than low frequency, produces less heat, not to mention sparkle, resulting in less burned tissue. Absolute output power at every mode of Coagulation, Blend, Bipolar like variable power of general ESU. Fast healing with excellent results.&nbsp;</p><ul><li>Provides smooth cuts with optimal performance on adipose tissues. It minimizes the carbonization and second bleeding by adhesion of the tissue</li><li>Complex patient protect system for more safety</li><li>2 Monopolar output</li><li>Various Cutting</li><li>Coagulation</li><li>Bipolar Modes</li><li>Spray coagulation function</li></ul>\";s:6:\"button\";a:6:{s:9:\"link_type\";s:6:\"custom\";s:16:\"link_type_custom\";s:0:\"\";s:14:\"link_type_post\";s:0:\"\";s:27:\"link_type_post_type_archive\";s:0:\"\";s:26:\"link_type_taxonomy_archive\";s:0:\"\";s:9:\"link_text\";s:0:\"\";}}}}}}}',1218,'http://www.ig-medical.com/2017/11/10/1218-revision-v1/',0,'revision','',0),(2837,1,'2017-11-10 19:23:50','2017-11-10 18:23:50','\n\n\n\n<a href=\"#more\">\n\nTAB Series - Manual hydraulic														\n\n<img width=\"511\" height=\"323\" src=\"http://www.ig-medical.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/tab-manual.jpg\" />				\n\n<!-- .container -->\n								 <!-- .overlay -->\n\n</a>\n\nTAB Series &#8211; Manual hydraulic			\nEnables a wide range of configurations for general and special surgery\nAccommodates larger patients, and offers excellent access to the operated site thanks to its design and adjustment options\nCompact and durable\nCost effective with high quality\nHeavy-duty casters with low noise and high mobility\nReliable hydraulic systems for a steady and swift lifting up/down\nIntegrated Kidney elevator\nDual-layer slow-elastic memory foam pad\nMore comfort and balance stress\nOrthopaedic tractor and skull clamp as optional\nTable board is radiolucent with X-ray film cassette\n\n','Manual','','inherit','closed','closed','','1216-revision-v1','','','2017-11-10 19:23:50','2017-11-10 18:23:50','a:4:{s:7:\"post_i