yer slow-elastic memory foam pad</li>\r\n 	<li>More comfort and balance stress</li>\r\n 	<li>Orthopaedic tractor and skull clamp as optional</li>\r\n 	<li>Table board is radiolucent with X-ray film cassette</li>\r\n</ul>\";s:6:\"filter\";s:1:\"1\";s:6:\"visual\";s:1:\"1\";}}}}',1216,'http://www.ig-medical.com/2017/11/10/1216-revision-v1/',0,'revision','',0),(3201,1,'2017-11-10 19:54:03','2017-11-10 18:54:03','\n\n\n\n<a href=\"#more\">\n\nXP Series - Handheld														\n\n<img width=\"120\" height=\"143\" src=\"http://www.ig-medical.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/Handheld-e1507731177663.jpg\" />				\n\n<!-- .container -->\n								 <!-- .overlay -->\n\n</a>\n\nProduct features:								\n\n3.5 inch TFTMonitoring the EtCO2/CO2 , Respiration rate,SpO2 &nbsp;and Pulse ( optional)Zero readjustment system for the accuracy and stabilityBalance gas compensation makes minimum influence against other gasesLung pressure and temperature compensation is selectableLung pressure and temperature compensation is selectableAudio-optical alarm for exceeding limits and &nbsp;Apnea24 hours trend diagram keeps still available after power-offData output via USB portLarge Capacity lithium battery for 10 hours UPSadult, paediatric or neonate modesOptional:Touch screen operation ,Record of patient data in 7200 hoursVSDI ,Data and waveforms achieved can be automatically transferred to the bedside patient monitor,Emergency, Surgery, ICU continuous monitoring\n\n<!-- /row -->\n\n','Handheld','','inherit','closed','closed','','1201-revision-v1','','','2017-11-10 19:54:03','2017-11-10 18:54:03','a:4:{s:7:\"post_id\";i:1201;s:9:\"post_hash\";s:44:\"layers_page_f7b40f778721b0acb20b431269287566\";s:10:\"post_title\";s:8:\"Handheld\";s:11:\"widget_data\";a:1:{s:24:\"obox-layers-builder-1201\";a:2:{s:22:\"layers-widget-slide-38\";a:14:{s:26:\"autoheight_slides-CHECKBOX\";s:2:\"on\";s:12:\"slide_height\";s:3:\"550\";s:6:\"design\";a:1:{s:8:\"advanced\";a:5:{s:7:\"padding\";a:4:{s:3:\"top\";s:0:\"\"