;s:26:\"link_type_taxonomy_archive\";s:0:\"\";s:9:\"link_text\";s:8:\"See More\";}}}}s:7:\"text-17\";a:4:{s:5:\"title\";s:7:\"Quality\";s:4:\"text\";s:338:\"As a leading manufacturer of medical technology and electronics, we provide our customers first-class quality and excellent products.\r\n\r\nOur company IG GmbH as well as our products are ISO 13485:2012 and CE certified  according to respective requirements in the European directive 93/42/ EEC concerning medical devices which apply to it.\";s:6:\"filter\";s:1:\"1\";s:6:\"visual\";s:1:\"1\";}s:14:\"media_image-16\";a:15:{s:13:\"attachment_id\";s:4:\"2383\";s:3:\"url\";s:69:\"http://www.ig-medical.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/11/Certificates.png\";s:5:\"title\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"size\";s:4:\"full\";s:5:\"width\";s:4:\"1393\";s:6:\"height\";s:3:\"649\";s:7:\"caption\";s:0:\"\";s:3:\"alt\";s:0:\"\";s:9:\"link_type\";s:4:\"none\";s:8:\"link_url\";s:0:\"\";s:13:\"image_classes\";s:0:\"\";s:12:\"link_classes\";s:0:\"\";s:8:\"link_rel\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"link_target_blank\";s:0:\"\";s:11:\"image_title\";s:0:\"\";}}}}',1679,'http://www.ig-medical.com/2017/12/01/1679-revision-v1/',0,'revision','',0),(4687,1,'2017-12-01 12:21:51','2017-12-01 11:21:51','\n\n\n\n<a href=\"#more\">\n\n<img width=\"1973\" height=\"1285\" src=\"http://www.ig-medical.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/08/IG-International-Group-medical-technology-and-electronics-GmbH.png\" />				\n\n<!-- .container -->\n								 <!-- .overlay -->\n\n</a>\n\nInternational group medical technology and electronics GmbH			The International Group medical technology and electronics GmbH,  located in Bremen-Germany is dedicated to develope, manufacture and distribute: Innovative, high performance and efficient medical equipment.\n&nbsp;\nIt is our mission to facilitate the work of doctors and care personnel as well as establish long-term esteeming relationships with our customers.\nOur products are marked by outstanding quality and maximum reliability. These are features that, while striving to reach perfection, we continue to optimize through an ongoing process of innovation.\n&nbsp;\nIn the field of medical technology and equipment, where the life and wellbeing of patient is at stake, quality and reliability is imperative. Patients, users and retailers can rely on the experience and expert knowledge of the IG team.\n&nbsp;\nThe international team of doctors and engineers is working hard on the research, development, manufacture, and sales of medical equipment and have recourse to over 20 years of experience and technical knowledge. Developing new products we take the needs and feedback of users, i.e. doctors and care personnel, into account, in addition to our technical knowhow.\n&nbsp;\nMultiple costumers are already convinced of the exceptional quality of our products. Currently we have established a network of costumers in many countries on various continents. In the pursuit of expanding this network we focus on long-term business relations.\n&nbsp;\n&nbsp;\nAt the moment we can provide three product ranges:\n\nOperating-room and ICU equipment (<a href=\"http://www.ig-medical.de\">IG Medical</a>):\nPatient monitors\nECG machines\nElectrosurgical generators\nSurgical lighting\nOperating tables\nGastroenterology (<a href=\"http://www.endocure.de\" target=\"_blank\">Endocure</a>):\nFull range of flexible endoscopic accessories\nElectro-Gastro-Graphs. (E.G.G.)\nCapsule Endoscope Systems\nDiagnostic equipment (<a href=\"http://www.ig-technology.de\" target=\"_blank\">IG Technology</a>):\nInnovative and cost-effective diagnostic technology\n\n&nbsp;\nOur company International group medical technology and electronics GmbH as well as our products are ISO 13485:2012 and CE certified according to respective requirements in the European directive 93/42/ EEC concerning medical devices which apply to it. \n&nbsp;\n\n<img width=\"300\" height=\"127\" src=\"http://www.ig-medical.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/11/TÜV-300x127.png\" />','About us','','inherit','closed','closed','','1277-revision-v1','','','2017-12-01 12:21:51','2017-12-01 11:21:51','a:4:{s:7:\"post_id\";i:1277;s:9:\"post_hash\";s:44:\"layers_page_20ab8b58604b44b3799801fe463625b9\";s:10:\"post_title\";s:8:\"About us\";s:11:\"widget_data\";a:1:{s:24:\"obox-layers-builder-1277\";a:3:{s:22:\"layers-widget-slide-46\";a:14:{s:26:\"autoheight_slides-CHECKBOX\";s:2:\"on\";s:12:\"slide_height\";s:3:\"550\";s:6:\"design\";a:1:{s:8:\"advanced\";a:5:{s:7:\"padding\";a:4:{s:3:\"top\";s:0:\"\";s:5:\"right\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"bottom\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"left\";s:0:\"\";}s:6:\"margin\";a:4:{s:3:\"top\";s:0:\"\";s:5:\"right\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"bottom\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"left\";s:0:\"\";}s:6:\"anchor\";s:0:\"\";s:11:\"customclass\";s:0:\"\";s:9:\"customcss\";s:0:\"\";}}s:18:\"show_slider_arrows\";s:2:\"on\";s:27:\"show_slider_arrows-CHECKBOX\";s:2:\"on\";s:16:\"show_slider_dots\";s:2:\"on\";s:25:\"show_slider_dots-CHECKBOX\";s:2:\"on\";s:18:\"slider_arrow_color\";s:0:\"\";s:14:\"animation_type\";s:5:\"slide\";s:24:\"autoplay_slides-CHECKBOX\";s:2:\"on\";s:10:\"slide_time\";s:0:\"\";s:11:\"focus_slide\";s:1:\"1\";s:9:\"slide_ids\";s:2:\"93\";s:6:\"slides\";a:1:{i:93;a:4:{s:6:\"design\";a:6:{s:10:\"background\";a:6:{s:5:\"color\";s:7:\"#f8f8f8\";s:5:\"image\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"repeat\";s:9:\"no-repeat\";s:8:\"position\";s:6:\"center\";s:16:\"stretch-CHECKBOX\";s:2:\"on\";s:15:\"darken-CHECKBOX\";s:2:\"on\";}s:13:\"featuredimage\";s:119:\"http://www.ig-medical.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/08/IG-International-Group-medical-technology-and-electronics-GmbH.png\";s:13:\"featuredvideo\";s:0:\"\";s:10:\"imagealign\";s:9:\"image-top\";s:5:\"fonts\";a:4:{s:4:\"size\";s:5:\"large\";s:5:\"align\";s:11:\"text-center\";s:5:\"color\";s:0:\"\";s:13:\"excerpt-color\";s:0:\"\";}s:8:\"advanced\";a:1:{s:11:\"customclass\";s:0:\"\";}}s:5:\"title\";s:0:\"\";s:7:\"excerpt\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"button\";a:6:{s:9:\"link_type\";s:6:\"custom\";s:16:\"link_type_custom\";s:5:\"#more\";s:14:\"link_type_post\";s:0:\"\";s:27:\"link_type_post_type_archive\";s:0:\"\";s:26:\"link_type_taxonomy_archive\";s:0:\"\";s:9:\"link_text\";s:0:\"\";}}}}s:7:\"text-48\";a:4:{s:5:\"title\";s:59:\"International group medical technology and electronics GmbH\";s:4:\"text\";s:2541:\"<p class=\"style10\">The International Group medical technology and electronics GmbH,  located in Bremen-Germany is dedicated to develope, manufacture and distribute: Innovative, high performance and efficient medical equipment.</p>\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\nIt is our mission to facilitate the work of doctors and care personnel as well as establish long-term esteeming relationships with our customers.\r\n\r\nOur products are marked by outstanding quality and maximum reliability. These are features that, while striving to reach perfection, we continue to optimize through an ongoing process of innovation.\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\nIn the field of medical technology and equipment, where the life and wellbeing of patient is at stake, quality and reliability is imperative. Patients, users and retailers can rely on the experience and expert knowledge of the IG team.\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\nThe international team of doctors and engineers is working hard on the research, development, manufacture, and sales of medical equipment and have recourse to over 20 years of experience and technical knowledge. Developing new products we take the needs and feedback of users, i.e. doctors and care personnel, into account, in addition to our technical knowhow.\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\nMultiple costumers are already convinced of the exceptional quality of our products. Currently we have established a network of costumers in many countries on various continents. In the pursuit of expanding this network we focus on long-term business relations.\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n<strong>At the moment we can provide three product ranges</strong>:\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li><strong>Operating-room and ICU equipment (<a href=\"http://www.ig-medical.de\">IG Medical</a>):</strong>\r\nPatient monitors\r\nECG machines\r\nElectrosurgical generators\r\nSurgical lighting\r\nOperating tables</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Gastroenterology (<a href=\"http://www.endocure.de\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Endocure</a>):</strong>\r\nFull range of flexible endoscopic accessories\r\nElectro-Gastro-Graphs. (E.G.G.)\r\nCapsule Endoscope Systems</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Diagnostic equipment (<a href=\"http://www.ig-technology.de\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">IG Technology</a>):</strong>\r\nInnovative and cost-effective diagnostic technology</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n&nbsp;\r\n<p class=\"style10\"><strong>Our company International group medical technology and electronics GmbH as well as our products are ISO 13485:2012 and CE certified according to respective requirements in the European directive 93/42/ EEC concerning medical devices which apply to it. </strong></p>\r\n&nbsp;\";s:6:\"filter\";s:1:\"1\";s:6:\"visual\";s:1:\"1\";}s:14:\"media_image-19\";a:15:{s:13:\"attachment_id\";s:4:\"2580\";s:3:\"url\";s:69:\"http://www.ig-medical.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/11/TÜV-300x127.png\";s:5:\"title\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"size\";s:6:\"medium\";s:5:\"width\";s:3:\"881\";s:6:\"height\";s:3:\"373\";s:7:\"caption\";s:0:\"\";s:3:\"alt\";s:0:\"\";s:9:\"link_type\";s:4:\"none\";s:8:\"link_url\";s:0:\"\";s:13:\"image_classes\";s:0:\"\";s:12:\"link_classes\";s:0:\"\";s:8:\"link_rel\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"link_target_blank\";s:0:\"\";s:11:\"image_title\";s:0:\"\";}}}}',1277,'http://www.ig-medical.com/2017/12/01/1277-revision-v1/',0,'revision','',0),(4689,1,'2017-12-01 12:21:52','2017-12-01 11:21:52','\n\n\n\n<a href=\"#more\">\n\nMAX Series - MAX VI														\n\n<img width=\"3592\" height=\"1246\" src=\"http://www.ig-medical.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/11/MAX.png\" />				\n\n<!-- .container -->\n								 <!-- .overlay -->\n\n</a>\n\n<img width=\"4021\" height=\"2533\" src=\"http://www.ig-medical.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/11/MAX-VI.png\" />				\n\nProduct features:																											\n																																					Up to 400Watt output power, much more efficient than low frequency, produces less heat, not to mention sparkle, resulting in less burFFned tissue. Absolute output power at every mode of Coagulation, Blend, Bipolar like variable power of general ESU. &nbsp;It minimizes the carbonization and second bleeding by adhesion of the tissue.&nbsp;User can save or open their frequently used data/favorite programs up to 100 programmable memory locations with several touch motions.High resolution touch screen controlFast healing with excellent results.&nbsp;Provides smooth cuts with optimal performance on adipose tissuesComplex patient protect system for more safetyREM system2 Monopolar outputVarious CuttingCoagulation and Bipolar ModesSpray coagulation fuctionLarge vessel sealing systemEndo ModeBipolar Cutting Mode<a href=\"http://www.ig-medical.com/kontaktseite/\">More Info</a>\n\n<!-- /row -->\n\n','MAX VI','','inherit','closed','closed','','1238-revision-v1','','','2017-12-01 12:21:52','2017-12-01 11:21:52','a:4:{s:7:\"post_id\";i:1238;s:9:\"post_hash\";s:44:\"layers_page_a5da4cb4893a1e618863fe58a9d25228\";s:10:\"post_title\";s:6:\"MAX VI\";s:11:\"widget_data\";a:1:{s:24:\"obox-layers-builder-1238\";a:2:{s:22:\"layers-widget-slide-30\";a:14:{s:6:\"design\";a:2:{s:6:\"layout\";s:16:\"layout-fullwidth\";s:8:\"advanced\";a:5:{s:7:\"padding\";a:4:{s:3:\"top\";s:0:\"\";s:5:\"right\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"bottom\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"left\";s:0:\"\";}s:6:\"margin\";a:4:{s:3:\"top\";s:0:\"\";s:5:\"right\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"bottom\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"left\";s:0:\"\";}s:6:\"anchor\";s:0:\"\";s:11:\"customclass\";s:0:\"\";s:9:\"customcss\";s:0:\"\";}}s:26:\"autoheight_slides-CHECKBOX\";s:2:\"on\";s:12:\"slide_height\";s:3:\"550\";s:18:\"show_slider_arrows\";s:2:\"on\";s:27:\"show_slider_arrows-CHECKBOX\";s:2:\"on\";s:16:\"show_slider_dots\";s:2:\"on\";s:25:\"show_slider_dots-CHECKBOX\";s:2:\"on\";s:18:\"slider_arrow_color\";s:0:\"\";s:14:\"animation_type\";s:5:\"sli