 storage</li><li>Up to 480h trend/graphic storage and review</li></ul></li><li>S-T segment anylisis and &gt;23 tpyes of arrhythmia analysis</li><li>Suitable for adult, peadiatric and neonate patients</li><li>Easy drug calculation interface</li><li>Defibrillator discharge protection</li><li>Bed to bed view for comfortable patient visit</li><li>Visual and audible alarms</li><li>Rechargeable and exchangeable batteries( up to 10 hours working time)</li></ul><p><br></p><div style=\"text-align:center; width:8em; background:#5B92D3;\"><a href=\"http://www.ig-medical.com/kontaktseite/\" style=\"color:white;text-decoration:none;font-size:1.5em;\">More Info</a></div><p><br></p>\";s:6:\"button\";a:6:{s:9:\"link_type\";s:6:\"custom\";s:16:\"link_type_custom\";s:0:\"\";s:14:\"link_type_post\";s:0:\"\";s:27:\"link_type_post_type_archive\";s:0:\"\";s:26:\"link_type_taxonomy_archive\";s:0:\"\";s:9:\"link_text\";s:0:\"\";}}}}}}}',187,'http://www.ig-medical.com/2017/12/18/187-revision-v1/',0,'revision','',0),(5269,1,'2017-12-18 15:03:01','2017-12-18 14:03:01','\n\nImpressum								\n																						International Group medical technology and electronics GmbH\n\nEllhornstraße 12/1428195 Bremen, GermanyP: +49 (0) 421 / 8478 8804F: +49 (0) 421 / 5956 4661E: info@ig-medical.de\n\nLegal information:																											\n																																					Ust IdNr: De278597848HRB 27212 Amtsgericht BremenCEO: Dipl. Ing. Shedid\n\n<!-- /row -->\n\n','Impressum','','inherit','closed','closed','','163-revision-v1','','','2017-12-18 15:03:01','2017-12-18 14:03:01','a:4:{s:7:\"post_id\";i:163;s:9:\"post_hash\";s:44:\"layers_page_eb37352598c28a52709c6daa01c92652\";s:10:\"post_title\";s:9:\"Impressum\";s:11:\"widget_data\";a:1:{s:23:\"obox-layers-builder-163\";a:1:{s:22:\"layers-widget-column-6\";a:5:{s:6:\"design\";a:7:{s:6:\"layout\";s:12:\"layout-boxed\";s:8:\"advanced\";a:5:{s:7:\"padding\";a:4:{s:3:\"top\";s:0:\"\";s:5:\"right\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"bottom\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"left\";s:0: