ehensive range of accessories, the electro-hydraulic table an be configured for each surgical procedure and for all patient sizes in the best possible way. lt provides open access to the operated area and creates excellent working ergonomics for the surgical team without compromising on patient safety. All electro-hydraulic adjustments are controlled via user friendly hand controls, either wireless or wired, or foot control units.\n\n<a href=\"http://www.ig-medical.com/startseite/surgical-table-1/electro-hydraulic/\">\n							<img width=\"4217\" height=\"2409\" src=\"http://www.ig-medical.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/11/Electro-hydraulic-VG.jpg\" />						</a>\n\n<a href=\"http://www.ig-medical.com/startseite/surgical-table-1/electro-hydraulic/\">\n																													TAB Series - Electro-hydraulic																													</a>\n\n.\n\n<a href=\"http://www.ig-medical.com/startseite/surgical-table-1/electric-table/\">\n							<img width=\"661\" height=\"357\" src=\"http://www.ig-medical.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/tab-electro-hydraulic.jpg\" />						</a>\n\n<a href=\"http://www.ig-medical.com/startseite/surgical-table-1/electric-table/\">\n																													TAB Series - Electric (Motorized)																													</a>\n\n<a href=\"http://www.ig-medical.com/startseite/surgical-table-1/manual/\">\n							<img width=\"511\" height=\"323\" src=\"http://www.ig-medical.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/tab-manual.jpg\" />						</a>\n\n<a href=\"http://www.ig-medical.com/startseite/surgical-table-1/manual/\">\n																													TAB Series - Manual																													</a>\n\n<!-- /row -->\n\n','Surgical table','','inherit','closed','closed','','492-revision-v1','','','2018-01-17 14:02:58','2018-01-17 13:02:58','a:4:{s:7:\"post_id\";i:492;s:9:\"post_hash\";s:44:\"layers_page_065a0609aefa4cf6d442fb9e33a11a43\";s:10:\"post_title\";s:14:\"Surgical table\";s:11:\"widget_data\";a:1:{s:23:\"obox-layers-builder-492\";a:3:{s:21:\"layers-w