/2017/11/IG.png\" />				\n\n<!-- .container -->\n								 <!-- .overlay -->\n\n</a>\n\nWelcome at IG Medical																											\n																																					We are a leading manufacturer of medical equipment located in Bremen, Germany.Our focus is on the demand of the patient and the medical staff. Our products meet the needs of modern medical development, which are safe, efficient and low cost oriented.High standards, reliable quality and continuous innovations are our highest commandments.\n\n<!-- /row -->\n\nOur products								\n\n<a href=\"http://www.ig-medical.com/startseite/electrocardiograph-2/\">\n																													<img src=\"http://www.ig-medical.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/01/Optiion-2.png\" /> 																													</a>\n\n<!-- /row -->\n\n','Products','','inherit','closed','closed','','39-revision-v1','','','2018-01-17 14:03:00','2018-01-17 13:03:00','a:4:{s:7:\"post_id\";i:39;s:9:\"post_hash\";s:44:\"layers_page_b523231988a37515a7c52edd0d37a969\";s:10:\"post_title\";s:8:\"Products\";s:11:\"widget_data\";a:1:{s:22:\"obox-layers-builder-39\";a:3:{s:21:\"layers-widget-slide-5\";a:16:{s:6:\"design\";a:2:{s:6:\"layout\";s:18:\"layout-full-screen\";s:8:\"advanced\";a:5:{s:7:\"padding\";a:4:{s:3:\"top\";s:0:\"\";s:5:\"right\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"bottom\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"left\";s:0:\"\";}s:6:\"margin\";a:4:{s:3:\"top\";s:0:\"\";s:5:\"right\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"bottom\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"left\";s:0:\"\";}s:6:\"anchor\";s:0:\"\";s:11:\"customclass\";s:0:\"\";s:9:\"customcss\";s:0:\"\";}}s:17:\"autoheight_slides\";s:2:\"on\";s:26:\"autoheight_slides-CHECKBOX\";s:2:\"on\";s:12:\"slide_height\";s:3:\"550\";s:18:\"show_slider_arrows\";s:2:\"on\";s:27:\"show_slider_arrows-CHECKBOX\";s:2:\"on\";s:16:\"show_slider_dots\";s:2:\"on\";s:25:\"show_slider_dots-CHECKBOX\";s:2:\"on\";s:18:\"slider_arrow_color\";s:7:\"#ba1f00\";s:14:\"animation_type\";s:8:\"parallax\";s:15:\"autoplay_slides\";s:2:\"on\";s:24:\"autoplay_slides-CHECKBOX\";s:2:\"on\";s:10:\"