droppable\">Please do not hesitate to contact us at <a href=\"mailto:support@ig-medical.de\">support@ig-medical.de</a>. We shall process your request immediately.\r\n\r\nCompetent, individual consulting and error diagnosis is a matter of course.</div>\";s:6:\"filter\";s:1:\"1\";s:6:\"visual\";s:1:\"1\";}}}}',1694,'http://www.ig-medical.com/2019/09/17/1694-revision-v1/',0,'revision','',0),(6850,1,'2019-09-17 08:37:55','2019-09-17 06:37:55','\n\n\n							\n\n\n													\n\n<img width=\"3712\" height=\"1364\" src=\"http://www.ig-medical.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/11/IG.png\" />				\n\n<!-- .container -->\n								 <!-- .overlay -->\n\nSlider Title														\n																																								Kurze Zusammenfassung\n																																								<a href=\"#more\">\n															See More														</a>\n\n<!-- .container -->\n								 <!-- .overlay -->\n\nQuality			As a leading manufacturer of medical technology and electronics, we provide our customers first-class quality and excellent products.\nOur company International Group medical technology and electronics GmbH as well as our products are ISO 13485:2012 and CE certified  according to respective requirements in the European directive 93/42/ EEC concerning medical devices which apply to it.\n\n<img width=\"1393\" height=\"649\" src=\"http://www.ig-medical.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/11/Certificates.png\" />','Quality','','inherit','closed','closed','','1679-revision-v1','','','2019-09-17 08:37:55','2019-09-17 06:37:55','a:4:{s:7:\"post_id\";i:1679;s:9:\"post_hash\";s:44:\"layers_page_1e460464e76c8753e27c41a4c9f0b05c\";s:10:\"post_title\";s:7:\"Quality\";s:11:\"widget_data\";a:1:{s:24:\"obox-layers-builder-1679\";a:3:{s:22:\"layers-widget-slide-15\";a:14:{s:26:\"autoheight_slides-CHECKBOX\";s:2:\"on\";s:12:\"slide_height\";s:3:\"550\";s:6:\"design\";a:1:{s:8:\"advanced\";a:5:{s:7:\"padding\";a:4:{s:3:\"top\";s:0:\"\";s:5:\"right\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"bottom\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"left\";s:0:\"\";}s: