163,'http://www.ig-medical.com/2019/09/17/163-revision-v1/',0,'revision','',0),(6888,1,'2019-09-17 08:39:04','2019-09-17 06:39:04','\n\n\n\n<a href=\"#more\">\n\n<img width=\"1973\" height=\"1285\" src=\"http://www.ig-medical.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/08/IG-International-Group-medical-technology-and-electronics-GmbH.png\" />				\n\n<!-- .container -->\n								 <!-- .overlay -->\n\n</a>\n\nThe International Group medical technology and electronics GmbH			The International Group medical technology and electronics GmbH,  located in Bremen-Germany is dedicated to develope, manufacture and distribute: Innovative, high performance and efficient medical equipment.\n&nbsp;\nIt is our mission to facilitate the work of doctors and care personnel as well as establish long-term esteeming relationships with our customers.\nOur products are marked by outstanding quality and maximum reliability. These are features that, while striving to reach perfection, we continue to optimize through an ongoing process of innovation.\n&nbsp;\nIn the field of medical technology and equipment, where the life and wellbeing of patient is at stake, quality and reliability is imperative. Patients, users and retailers can rely on the experience and expert knowledge of the IG team.\n&nbsp;\nThe international team of doctors and engineers is working hard on the research, development, manufacture, and sales of medical equipment and have recourse to over 20 years of experience and technical knowledge. Developing new products we take the needs and feedback of users, i.e. doctors and care personnel, into account, in addition to our technical knowhow.\n&nbsp;\nMultiple costumers are already convinced of the exceptional quality of our products. Currently we have established a network of costumers in many countries on various continents. In the pursuit of expanding this network we focus on long-term business relations.\n&nbsp;\n&nbsp;\nAt the moment we can provide three product ranges:\n\nOperating-room and ICU equipment (<a href=\"http://www.ig-medical.de\">IG Medical</a>):\nPatient monitors\nECG machines\nElectrosurgical generators\nSurgical lighting\nOperating tables\nGastroenterology (<a href=\"http://www.endocure.de\" target=\"_blank\">Endocure</a>):\nFull range of flexible endoscopic accessories\nElectro-Gastro-Graphs. (E.G.G.)\nCapsule Endoscope Systems\nDiagnostic equipment (<a href=\"http://www.ig-technology.de\" target=\"_blank\">IG Technology</a>):\nInnovative and cost-effective diagnostic technology\n\n&nbsp;\nOur company International group medical technology and electronics GmbH as well as our products are ISO 13485:2012 and CE certified according to respective requirements in the European directive 93/42/ EEC concerning medical devices which apply to it. \n&nbsp;\n\n<img width=\"300\" height=\"127\" src=\"http://www.ig-medical.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/11/TÜV-300x127.png\" />','Company','','inherit','closed','closed','','56-revision-v1','','','2019-09-17 08:39:04','2019-09-17 06:39:04','a:4:{s:7:\"post_id\";i:56;s:9:\"post_hash\";s:44:\"layers_page_40d650334fb3bd5de41aa1be691853af\";s:10:\"post_title\";s:7:\"Company\";s:11:\"widget_data\";a:1:{s:22:\"obox-layers-builder-56\";a:3:{s:21:\"layers-widget-slide-8\";a:16:{s:6:\"design\";a:2:{s:6:\"layout\";s:12:\"layout-boxed\";s:8:\"advanced\";a:5:{s:7:\"padding\";a:4:{s:3:\"top\";s:0:\"\";s:5:\"right\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"bottom\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"left\";s:0:\"\";}s:6:\"margin\";a:4:{s:3:\"top\";s:0:\"\";s:5:\"right\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"bottom\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"left\";s:0:\"\";}s:6:\"anchor\";s:0:\"\";s:11:\"customclass\";s:0:\"\";s:9:\"customcss\";s:0:\"\";}}s:17:\"autoheight_slides\";s:2:\"on\";s:26:\"autoheight_slides-CHECKBOX\";s:2:\"on\";s:12:\"slide_height\";s:3:\"550\";s:18:\"show_slider_arrows\";s:2:\"on\";s:27:\"show_slider_arrows-CHECKBOX\";s:2:\"on\";s:16:\"show_slider_dots\";s:2:\"on\";s:25:\"show_slider_dots-CHECKBOX\";s:2:\"on\";s:18:\"slider_arrow_color\";s:7:\"#ba1f00\";s:14:\"animation_type\";s:8:\"parallax\";s:15:\"autoplay_slides\";s:2:\"on\";s:24:\"autoplay_slides-CHECKBOX\";s:2:\"on\";s:10:\"slide_time\";s:1:\"5\";s:11:\"focus_slide\";s:1:\"1\";s:9:\"slide_ids\";s:3:\"840\";s:6:\"slides\";a:1:{i:840;a:4:{s:6:\"design\";a:6:{s:10:\"background\";a:6:{s:5:\"color\";s:0:\"\";s:5:\"image\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"repeat\";s:9:\"no-repeat\";s:8:\"position\";s:6:\"center\";s:16:\"stretch-CHECKBOX\";s:2:\"on\";s:15:\"darken-CHECKBOX\";s:2:\"on\";}s:13:\"featuredimage\";s:119:\"http://www.ig-medical.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/08/IG-International-Group-medical-technology-and-electronics-GmbH.png\";s:13:\"featuredvideo\";s:0:\"\";s:10:\"imagealign\";s:9:\"image-top\";s:5:\"fonts\";a:4:{s:4:\"size\";s:5:\"large\";s:5:\"align\";s:11:\"text-center\";s:5:\"color\";s:0:\"\";s:13:\"excerpt-color\";s:0:\"\";}s:8:\"advanced\";a:1:{s:11:\"customclass\";s:0:\"\";}}s:5:\"title\";s:0:\"\";s:7:\"excerpt\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"button\";a:6:{s:9:\"link_type\";s:6:\"custom\";s:16:\"link_type_custom\";s:5:\"#more\";s:14:\"link_type_post\";s:0:\"\";s:27:\"link_type_post_type_archive\";s:0:\"\";s:26:\"link_type_taxonomy_archive\";s:0:\"\";s:9:\"link_text\";s:0:\"\";}}}}s:7:\"text-50\";a:4:{s:5:\"title\";s:63:\"The International Group medical technology and electronics GmbH\";s:4:\"text\";s:2541:\"<p class=\"style10\">The International Group medical technology and electronics GmbH,  located in Bremen-Germany is dedicated to develope, manufacture and distribute: Innovative, high performance and efficient medical equipment.</p>\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\nIt is our mission to facilitate the work of doctors and care personnel as well as establish long-term esteeming relationships with our customers.\r\n\r\nOur products are marked by outstanding quality and maximum reliability. These are features that, while striving to reach perfection, we continue to optimize through an ongoing process of innovation.\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\nIn the field of medical technology and equipment, where the life and wellbeing of patient is at stake, quality and reliability is imperative. Patients, users and retailers can rely on the experience and expert knowledge of the IG team.\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\nThe international team of doctors and engineers is working hard on the research, development, manufacture, and sales of medical equipment and have recourse to over 20 years of experience and technical knowledge. Developing new products we take the needs and feedback of users, i.e. doctors and care personnel, into account, in addition to our technical knowhow.\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\nMultiple costumers are already convinced of the exceptional quality of our products. Currently we have established a network of costumers in many countries on various continents. In the pursuit of expanding this network we focus on long-term business relations.\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n<strong>At the moment we can provide three product ranges</strong>:\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li><strong>Operating-room and ICU equipment (<a href=\"http://www.ig-medical.de\">IG Medical</a>):</strong>\r\nPatient monitors\r\nECG machines\r\nElectrosurgical generators\r\nSurgical lighting\r\nOperating tables</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Gastroenterology (<a href=\"http://www.endocure.de\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Endocure</a>):</strong>\r\nFull range of flexible endoscopic accessories\r\nElectro-Gastro-Graphs. (E.G.G.)\r\nCapsule Endoscope Systems</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Diagnostic equipment (<a href=\"http://www.ig-technology.de\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">IG Technology</a>):</strong>\r\nInnovative and cost-effective diagnostic technology</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n&nbsp;\r\n<p class=\"style10\"><strong>Our company International group medical technology and electronics GmbH as well as our products are ISO 13485:2012 and CE certified according to respective requirements in the European directive 93/42/ EEC concerning medical devices which apply to it. </strong></p>\r\n&nbsp;\";s:6:\"filter\";s:1:\"1\";s:6:\"visual\";s:1:\"1\";}s:14:\"media_image-18\";a:15:{s:13:\"attachment_id\";s:4:\"2580\";s:3:\"url\";s:69:\"http://www.ig-medical.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/11/TÜV-300x127.png\";s:5:\"title\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"size\";s:6:\"medium\";s:5:\"width\";s:3:\"881\";s:6:\"height\";s:3:\"373\";s:7:\"caption\";s:0:\"\";s:3:\"alt\";s:0:\"\";s:9:\"link_type\";s:4:\"none\";s:8:\"link_url\";s:0:\"\";s:13:\"image_classes\";s:0:\"\";s:12:\"link_classes\";s:0:\"\";s:8:\"link_rel\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"link_target_blank\";s:0:\"\";s:11:\"image_title\";s:0:\"\";}}}}',56,'http://www.ig-medical.com/2019/09/17/56-revision-v1/',0,'revision','',0),(6889,1,'2019-09-17 08:39:05','2019-09-17 06:39:05','\n\n\n							\n\n\n													\n													\n													\n													\n													\n													\n													\n\n<a href=\"#more\">\n\n<img width=\"3721\" height=\"1262\" src=\"http://www.ig-medical.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/11/website.png\" />				\n\n<!-- .container -->\n								 <!-- .overlay -->\n\n</a>\n													<a href=\"#more\">\n\n<img width=\"3484\" height=\"1348\" src=\"http://www.ig-medical.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/11/LAM.png\" />				\n\n<!-- .container -->\n								 <!-- .overlay -->\n\n</a>\n													<a href=\"#more\">\n\n<img width=\"3642\" height=\"1244\" src=\"http://www.ig-medical.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/11/TAB-1.png\" />				\n\n<!-- .container -->\n								 <!-- .overlay -->\n\n</a>\n													<a href=\"#more\">\n\n<img width=\"3592\" height=\"1246\" src=\"http://www.ig-medical.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/11/MAX.png\" />				\n\n<!-- .container -->\n								 <!-- .overlay -->\n\n</a>\n													<a href=\"#more\">\n\n<img width=\"3671\" height=\"1236\" src=\"http://www.ig-medical.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/12/PM.png\" />				\n\n<!-- .container -->\n								 <!-- .overlay -->\n\n</a>\n													<a href=\"#more\">\n\n<img width=\"3626\" height=\"1207\" src=\"http://www.ig-medical.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/11/EKG.png\" />				\n\n<!-- .container -->\n								 <!-- .overlay -->\n\n</a>\n													<a href=\"#more\">\n\n<img width=\"3714\" height=\"1240\" src=\"http://www.ig-medical.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/11/IG-global.png\" />				\n\n<!-- .container -->\n								 <!-- .overlay -->\n\n</a>\n													<a href=\"#more\">\n\n<img width=\"3712\" height=\"1364\" src=\"http://www.ig-medical.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/11/IG.png\" />				\n\n<!-- .container -->\n								 <!-- .overlay -->\n\n</a>\n\nWelcome at IG Medical																											\n																																					We are a leading manufacturer of medical equipment located in Bremen, Germany.Our focus is on the demand of the patient and the medical staff. Our products meet the needs of modern medical development, which are safe, efficient and low cost oriented.High standards, reliable quality and continuous innovations are our highest commandments.\n\n<!-- /row -->\n\nOur products								\n\n<a href=\"http://www.ig-medical.com/startseite/electrocardiograph-2/\">\n																													<img src=\"http://www.ig-medical.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/01/Optiion-2.png\" /> 																													</a>\n\n<!-- /row -->\n\n','Products','','inherit','closed','closed','','39-revision-v1','','','2019-09-17 08:39:05','2019-09-17 06:39:05','a:4:{s:7:\"post_id\";i:39;s:9:\"post_hash\";s:44:\"layers_page_b523231988a37515a7c52edd0d37a969\";s:10:\"post_title\";s:8:\"Products\";s:11:\"widget_data\";a:1:{s:22:\"obox-layers-builder-39\";a:3:{s:21:\"layers-widget-slide-5\";a:16:{s:6:\"design\";a:2:{s:6:\"layout\";s:18:\"layout-full-screen\";s:8:\"advanced\";a:5:{s:7:\"padding\";a:4:{s:3:\"top\";s:0:\"\";s:5:\"right\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"bottom\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"left\";s:0:\"\";}s:6:\"margin\";a:4:{s:3:\"top\";s:0:\"\";s:5:\"right\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"bottom\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"left\";s:0:\"\";}s:6:\"anchor\";s:0:\"\";s:11:\"customclass\";s:0:\"\";s:9:\"customcss\";s:0:\"\";}}s:17:\"autoheight_slides\";s:2:\"on\";s:26:\"autoheight_slides-CHECKBOX\";s:2:\"on\";s:12:\"slide_height\";s:3:\"550\";s:18:\"show_slider_a